#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge0"
msgid ""
"Um, I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\n"
"Snivel… This tension is getting to me…$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。\n"
"呜……这种紧张感快把我压垮了……$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:5
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge1"
msgid ""
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\n"
"Here we come!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！\n"
"我们上了！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:9
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge2"
msgid ""
"I'm the no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice of {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"Accept my challenge!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！\n"
"接受我的挑战吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:13
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge3"
msgid ""
"Um… I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice…\n"
"Do you think someone like me can win?$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。\n"
"像我这样的人……能赢吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:17
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge4"
msgid ""
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\n"
"I'll let you challenge me!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！\n"
"我就让你挑战一下吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:21
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge5"
msgid ""
"I'm horribly busy, but I also happen\n"
"to be {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.$"
msgstr ""
"我忙得不可开交，不过我也是\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:25
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge6"
msgid ""
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\n"
"Glad to meet you!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。\n"
"很高兴认识你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:29
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge7"
msgid ""
"I serve as {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\n"
"May I begin?$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。\n"
"可以开始了吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:33
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge8"
msgid ""
"Eek! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\n"
"I'll do my best!$"
msgstr ""
"呀！我、我是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！我会加油的！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:37
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge9"
msgid ""
"Yeehaw! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\n"
"Put 'em up!$"
msgstr ""
"呀呼！我是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！放马过来吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:41
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge10"
msgid ""
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s 1,000th apprentice!\n"
"Actually, I'm no. {STR_VAR_2}! Here goes!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第1000号徒弟！\n"
"其实是第{STR_VAR_2}号啦！上吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:45
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge11"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!\n"
"Let's get rockin' and a-rollin'!$"
msgstr ""
"耶！我是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！一起摇滚吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:49
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge12"
msgid ""
"Yippee-yahoo! I'm what you call\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice!$"
msgstr ""
"呀呼呀吼！我就是传说中的\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:53
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge13"
msgid ""
"Cough! I'm {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice.\n"
"Good to meet you! Cough!$"
msgstr ""
"咳！我是{STR_VAR_1}的\n"
"第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。幸会！咳咳！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:57
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge14"
msgid ""
"This is nerve-racking…\n"
"I'm the no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice of {STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"好紧张啊……\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:61
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeChallenge15"
msgid ""
"I am {STR_VAR_1}'s no. {STR_VAR_2} apprentice,\n"
"and that's no lie.$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}的第{STR_VAR_2}号徒弟，\n"
"这可不是骗人的。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:65
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach0"
msgid ""
"Are you… {PLAYER}?\n"
"Oh! Sniff…sob…\p"
"Oh! S-sorry…\n"
"I'm so nervous, I can't help crying…\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}, and I really look up\n"
"to you, {PLAYER}.\p"
"I… I had this dream of one day meeting\n"
"you and asking you about POKéMON.\p"
"Please, please, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Please teach me about POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"你是……{PLAYER}？\n"
"啊！呜……呜呜……\p"
"啊！对、对不起……\n"
"我太紧张了，忍不住就哭了……\p"
"我叫{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"我一直很崇拜你，{PLAYER}。\p"
"我……我一直梦想着有一天能\n"
"见到你，向你请教宝可梦的事。\p"
"求求你了，{PLAYER}！\n"
"请教我宝可梦的知识吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:77
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching0"
msgid ""
"Oh… B-but…\n"
"Snivel… Waaaaaaah!\p"
"Please!\n"
"I'm begging you, please!$"
msgstr ""
"啊……可、可是……\n"
"呜呜……哇啊啊啊啊！\p"
"求求你！\n"
"我求你了，拜托！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:83
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode0"
msgid ""
"Oh, really? You will?\n"
"Awesome! Wicked! Awoooh!\p"
"Oh… I'm sorry…\n"
"I'm so happy, I'm crying…\p"
"Um… Then please tell me!\n"
"It's about the BATTLE TOWER.\p"
"Which would be better for me: Level 50\n"
"or the Open Level?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，真的吗？你答应了？\n"
"太棒了！太酷了！嗷呜——！\p"
"啊……对不起……\n"
"我太高兴了，都哭出来了……\p"
"嗯……那请告诉我吧！\n"
"是关于对战塔的事。\p"
"我应该挑战Lv.50，\n"
"还是自由等级呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:93
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks0"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Waaaaah!\p"
"Oh! I'm so sorry!\n"
"You've made me happy by choosing\l"
"the level for me, and it's made me cry…\p"
"Snivel…\n"
"Thank you so much!\l"
"Please talk with me again!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"哇啊啊啊！\p"
"啊！真对不起！\n"
"你帮我选了等级，\l"
"我太高兴了，就哭出来了……\p"
"呜呜……\n"
"真的非常感谢你！\l"
"下次再和我聊聊吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:103
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach1"
msgid ""
"Wowee! You're {PLAYER}, aren't you?\n"
"You're awesomely strong, aren't you?\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"I just became a TRAINER!\p"
"Please, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Can you be my teacher and tell me\l"
"lots about being a TRAINER?$"
msgstr ""
"哇！你就是{PLAYER}吧？\n"
"你超级厉害的对不对？\p"
"我叫{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我刚当上训练家！\p"
"拜托了，{PLAYER}！\n"
"你能当我的老师，\l"
"教我很多当训练家的事吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:112
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching1"
msgid ""
"Aww, why?\n"
"Oh, please? Pretty please?\l"
"Please be my teacher, please!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，为什么？\n"
"拜托嘛？求求你啦？\l"
"当我的老师吧，拜托！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:117
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode1"
msgid ""
"Yay! Great!\p"
"The first thing I wanted to ask you is\n"
"about the BATTLE TOWER!\p"
"The Level 50 and Open Level Rooms…\n"
"Which would be perfect for me?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！太好了！\p"
"我第一个想问的是\n"
"关于对战塔的事！\p"
"Lv.50和自由等级的房间……\n"
"哪个最适合我呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:124
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks1"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}, huh? That's true!\n"
"I'll do my best there!\p"
"If we meet here again, please teach\n"
"me something else, teacher!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}吗？说得对！\n"
"我会在那里加油的！\p"
"下次在这里遇到的话，\n"
"再教我别的事吧，老师！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:130
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach2"
msgid ""
"Um… Are you {PLAYER}?\n"
"My name is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I want to become a POKéMON TRAINER,\n"
"but I don't know what to do…\p"
"So I thought maybe I could ask you for\n"
"advice because you're so famous.\p"
"{PLAYER}, could you give me advice?$"
msgstr ""
"那个……你是{PLAYER}吗？\n"
"我叫{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我想成为宝可梦训练家，\n"
"但是不知道该怎么做……\p"
"所以我想，你那么有名，\n"
"也许可以向你请教。\p"
"{PLAYER}，能给我一些建议吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:139
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching2"
msgid ""
"Oh, but…\p"
"I sincerely want to become a POKéMON\n"
"TRAINER!\p"
"Please, can you answer my questions?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，可是……\p"
"我是真心想成为\n"
"宝可梦训练家！\p"
"拜托了，能回答我的问题吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:145
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode2"
msgid ""
"Thank you!\n"
"Here's my first question right away!\p"
"The BATTLE TOWER has two levels,\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level, right?\p"
"Which level do you think is more\n"
"suitable for me?$"
msgstr ""
"谢谢你！\n"
"那我马上问第一个问题！\p"
"对战塔有两种等级，\n"
"就是Lv.50和自由等级，对吧？\p"
"你觉得哪个等级\n"
"更适合我呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:153
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks2"
msgid ""
"Oh, the {STR_VAR_1} challenge?\n"
"Understood!\p"
"If I have another question, I'll come\n"
"back here for your advice!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，挑战{STR_VAR_1}吗？\n"
"明白了！\p"
"如果还有问题的话，\n"
"我会再来这里请教你的！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:159
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach3"
msgid ""
"Oh? Huh? You're…\n"
"No, that can't be true.\p"
"There isn't any way that someone\n"
"like me could meet {PLAYER}.\p"
"…You really are {PLAYER}?\n"
"I can't believe I'm talking to you!\p"
"When something this good happens,\n"
"only terrible things will happen to me\l"
"now, I just know it…\p"
"…I'm sorry…\n"
"I'm… {STR_VAR_1}…\p"
"There isn't anything special about\n"
"me that I can be proud of…\p"
"I shouldn't even say anything about\n"
"myself because you'll forget…\p"
"I had this dream that if I ever met\n"
"you, {PLAYER}, that maybe I could ask\l"
"you for advice as a TRAINER.\p"
"But I don't think you would agree\n"
"to that.\p"
"…Or will you be so kind as to give\n"
"me advice?$"
msgstr ""
"咦？啊？你是……\n"
"不，不可能。\p"
"像我这样的人，\n"
"怎么可能见到{PLAYER}呢。\p"
"……你真的是{PLAYER}？\n"
"真不敢相信我在和你说话！\p"
"遇到这么好的事，\n"
"接下来一定会有很糟糕的事\l"
"发生在我身上，我就知道……\p"
"……对不起……\n"
"我……叫{STR_VAR_1}……\p"
"我身上没有任何\n"
"值得骄傲的地方……\p"
"反正你也会忘记的，\n"
"我根本不该介绍自己……\p"
"我曾经梦想过，如果见到你，\n"
"{PLAYER}，也许能向你请教\l"
"当训练家的事。\p"
"但我觉得你\n"
"应该不会答应吧。\p"
"……还是说，你愿意好心地\n"
"给我一些建议呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:183
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching3"
msgid ""
"I knew it…\p"
"It had to happen because I'm such\n"
"a really boring nobody…\p"
"But I thought just maybe…\n"
"You won't reconsider, will you?\p"
"But I can't give up just like that.\n"
"I'll ask you while I'm still lucky!\p"
"Please, will you be so kind as to give\n"
"me advice?$"
msgstr ""
"我就知道……\p"
"谁让我是个\n"
"无聊透顶的小人物呢……\p"
"不过我还以为也许……\n"
"你不会再考虑一下吗？\p"
"但我不能就这么放弃。\n"
"趁我现在还走运，我再问一次！\p"
"请问你愿意好心地\n"
"给我一些建议吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:194
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode3"
msgid ""
"Really? I can't believe it!\n"
"I can't believe you'll advise me!\l"
"I… I'm so happy…\p"
"What I want to ask you is really\n"
"trivial, but I can't decide…\p"
"At the BATTLE TOWER, they let you\n"
"choose Level 50 or Open Level.\p"
"Which course do you think even I may\n"
"have a chance at?$"
msgstr ""
"真的吗？不敢相信！\n"
"你居然愿意指导我！\l"
"我……我好高兴……\p"
"我想问的事其实很琐碎，\n"
"但我就是拿不定主意……\p"
"在对战塔，可以选择\n"
"Lv.50或自由等级。\p"
"你觉得哪一种\n"
"连我也有机会赢呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:205
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks3"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}? Okay!\n"
"But do you really think someone like\l"
"me would have a chance?\p"
"I'll do my best, even though I don't\n"
"think it will work.\p"
"Thank you very much for spending\n"
"time with someone like me.$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}？好的！\n"
"不过像我这样的人\l"
"真的有机会吗？\p"
"虽然我觉得不会成功，\n"
"但我还是会尽力的。\p"
"谢谢你愿意花时间\n"
"陪我这样的人。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:214
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach4"
msgid ""
"Oh! You're {PLAYER}{KUN}, aren't you?\p"
"I've heard that you're tough at\n"
"POKéMON!\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"I'll be your friend!\p"
"Did you know?\p"
"You can't win at the BATTLE FRONTIER\n"
"if all you know is what they teach at\l"
"the TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\p"
"I'm willing to listen to your advice.\n"
"You'll agree, of course?$"
msgstr ""
"啊！你就是{PLAYER}{KUN}吧？\p"
"听说你的宝可梦对战\n"
"很厉害嘛！\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我就跟你交个朋友吧！\p"
"你知道吗？\p"
"光靠训练家学校教的东西，\n"
"在对战开拓区是赢不了的。\p"
"我愿意听听你的建议。\n"
"你当然会答应吧？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:227
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching4"
msgid ""
"Huh? Why are you refusing me?\n"
"It's me who's asking you!\l"
"You have to reconsider!$"
msgstr ""
"咦？为什么拒绝我？\n"
"是我在拜托你耶！\l"
"你得重新考虑一下！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:232
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode4"
msgid ""
"Okay, so there is this something.\n"
"I want you to decide it for me.\p"
"You know that the BATTLE TOWER has\n"
"Level 50 and Open Level Rooms?\p"
"Which do you think would be good\n"
"for me, {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"
msgstr ""
"好，有这么一件事，\n"
"我想让你帮我决定。\p"
"你知道对战塔有\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级的房间吧？\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你觉得\n"
"哪个比较适合我？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:240
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks4"
msgid ""
"Okay, {STR_VAR_1} is suitable for me?\n"
"Thank you!\p"
"Knowing that you made the decision,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\l"
"I lose.\p"
"Okay, I'll look to you for advice again.\n"
"Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"好，{STR_VAR_1}适合我是吧？\n"
"谢谢你！\p"
"既然是{PLAYER}{KUN}帮我决定的，\n"
"就算输了我也不会太难过。\p"
"好啦，下次再找你请教。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:249
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach5"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi, there! {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"I know you because you're famous!\l"
"Call me {STR_VAR_1}! Glad to meet you!\p"
"I'm a TRIATHLETE, so I keep myself\n"
"fit even while I raise POKéMON.\p"
"I'm also involved with other things\n"
"like work, napping, ballroom dancing…\p"
"Being this busy, it's not so easy for\n"
"me to become a decent TRAINER.\p"
"So, I have a proposition!\p"
"There must be a reason why we met.\n"
"So, {PLAYER}{KUN}, how about sharing your\l"
"wisdom with me every so often?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，你好啊！{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"你很有名，我认识你！\l"
"叫我{STR_VAR_1}就行！很高兴认识你！\p"
"我是铁人三项选手，所以\n"
"一边养宝可梦一边保持体能。\p"
"我还有其他事要忙，\n"
"像是工作、午睡、跳交际舞……\p"
"这么忙，要成为一个像样的\n"
"训练家可不容易啊。\p"
"所以，我有个提议！\p"
"我们相遇一定是有原因的。\n"
"所以，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你能不能\l"
"时不时地传授我一点经验？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:264
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching5"
msgid ""
"Oh, but, please?\n"
"A guy like me needs someone like\l"
"you, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Honestly, I need your advice!$"
msgstr ""
"噢，拜托啦？\n"
"像我这样的人需要\l"
"像你这样的人啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"说真的，我需要你的建议！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:270
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode5"
msgid ""
"Thank you! That's more like it!\n"
"So, let's start with an easy one!\p"
"You know about the BATTLE TOWER's\n"
"two courses, right?\l"
"You know, Level 50 and Open Level.\p"
"Me being a busy guy, which one should\n"
"I gear up for?$"
msgstr ""
"谢谢！这才对嘛！\n"
"那就从简单的开始吧！\p"
"你知道对战塔的\n"
"两种挑战吧？\l"
"就是Lv.50和自由等级。\p"
"像我这么忙的人，\n"
"应该准备哪一种呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:279
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks5"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}, huh? Okay, gotcha.\n"
"I'll find time somehow and give it a go!\p"
"…Whoops, I'd better go to work!\n"
"Thanks! See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}是吧？好，明白了。\n"
"我会想办法挤出时间去试试！\p"
"……哎呀，我得去上班了！\n"
"谢啦！回头见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:285
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach6"
msgid ""
"No way! Uh-uh!\n"
"Are you maybe the real {PLAYER}?\p"
"A-hah! Awesome! I'm {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"so pleased to meet you!\p"
"{PLAYER}, you're very strong,\n"
"aren't you?\p"
"Everyone's talking about you!\p"
"Oh! I just had this great idea!\n"
"I'll get advice off you, {PLAYER}!\l"
"I'm sure it will make me tougher!\p"
"Isn't it a great idea?\n"
"Please, I want your advice!$"
msgstr ""
"不会吧！不会吧！\n"
"你该不会是真正的{PLAYER}吧？\p"
"啊哈！太棒了！我叫{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"超高兴认识你！\p"
"{PLAYER}，你很强\n"
"对不对？\p"
"大家都在谈论你呢！\p"
"啊！我想到一个好主意！\n"
"我要向你请教，{PLAYER}！\l"
"这样我一定会变强的！\p"
"是不是很棒的主意？\n"
"拜托，我想听听你的建议！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:299
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching6"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha, you can pretend to be mean,\n"
"but you can't fool me!\l"
"You really mean okay, don't you?$"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈，你可以装出很凶的样子，\n"
"可是骗不了我的！\l"
"你其实是答应了，对吧？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:304
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode6"
msgid ""
"Yay! I knew you'd have a big heart,\n"
"{PLAYER}!\p"
"What should I ask you first?\n"
"…Oh, I thought of something!\p"
"Drum roll, please!\n"
"The question I have is…\p"
"If I were to take a BATTLE TOWER\n"
"challenge, which way should I go?\p"
"Level 50 or Open Level?\n"
"Which suits me more?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！我就知道你心肠很好，\n"
"{PLAYER}！\p"
"我该先问什么呢？\n"
"……啊，我想到了！\p"
"请来点鼓声！\n"
"我的问题是……\p"
"如果我要挑战对战塔，\n"
"应该选哪一种呢？\p"
"Lv.50还是自由等级？\n"
"哪个更适合我？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:316
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks6"
msgid ""
"Oh-oh-oh!\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}, you say!\l"
"Thank you for a totally cool reply!\p"
"I guess that's about all I wanted\n"
"to ask you today.\p"
"Let's meet here again, okay?\n"
"Thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"噢噢噢！\n"
"你说{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"谢谢你这么酷的回答！\p"
"我今天想问的\n"
"大概就这些了。\p"
"我们下次再在这里见面吧？\n"
"谢谢！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:325
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach7"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon, but…\n"
"Are you {PLAYER}?\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}, and I am delighted to\n"
"make your acquaintance.\p"
"I have long been an admirer\n"
"of yours…\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Um… I hope you don't find this\n"
"request too much of a burden, but…\p"
"May I become your apprentice,\n"
"{PLAYER}?$"
msgstr ""
"冒昧问一句……\n"
"请问您是{PLAYER}吗？\p"
"我叫{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"能认识您真是荣幸。\p"
"我仰慕您已久……\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"嗯……希望这个请求\n"
"不会给您带来负担……\p"
"{PLAYER}，我可以\n"
"成为您的徒弟吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:338
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching7"
msgid ""
"Oh…!\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"…I must have fainted from shock.\n"
"I'm sorry, I must have misheard you.\p"
"Please! Please say that you will\n"
"accept me as your apprentice!$"
msgstr ""
"啊……！\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"……我一定是吓晕过去了。\n"
"对不起，我一定是听错了。\p"
"拜托了！请您答应\n"
"收我为徒吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:347
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode7"
msgid ""
"Oh… I'm delighted!\p"
"I don't wish to waste your time,\n"
"so please advise me on this.\p"
"I plan to take a BATTLE TOWER\n"
"challenge soon.\p"
"However, there are two levels…\p"
"Which would be most suitable for me?\n"
"Level 50 or Open Level?$"
msgstr ""
"啊……我好高兴！\p"
"我不想浪费您的时间，\n"
"所以请在这件事上指点我。\p"
"我打算近期\n"
"去挑战对战塔。\p"
"不过，那里有两种等级……\p"
"哪一种最适合我呢？\n"
"Lv.50还是自由等级？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:357
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks7"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} is your choice!\n"
"I see. I will do my best!\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I hope I can count on you again.\l"
"Please take care!$"
msgstr ""
"您选的是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我明白了，我会努力的！\p"
"谢谢您，{PLAYER}。\n"
"希望以后还能仰仗您。\l"
"请多保重！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:364
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach8"
msgid ""
"Eek! Eek! {PLAYER}!\n"
"You spoke to me!\l"
"I… I'm overjoyed!\p"
"Me! My name is {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"I just became a TRAINER!\p"
"I'm delighted I met you, {PLAYER},\n"
"the big name in POKéMON circles!\p"
"Oh-oh-oh, I know!\n"
"May I ask a huge favor, {PLAYER}?\p"
"Please take me in as your apprentice!\n"
"I want to learn from you!$"
msgstr ""
"呀！呀！{PLAYER}！\n"
"你跟我说话了！\l"
"我……我高兴死了！\p"
"我！我叫{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我刚当上训练家！\p"
"能见到宝可梦界的大人物\n"
"{PLAYER}，我太开心了！\p"
"噢噢噢，对了！\n"
"{PLAYER}，能拜托你一件大事吗？\p"
"请收我为徒吧！\n"
"我想向你学习！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:377
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching8"
msgid ""
"Waaaah!\n"
"{PLAYER} turned me down…\l"
"It… It's an invaluable experience!\p"
"{PLAYER}, please! I want to hear\n"
"an affirmative answer this time!\p"
"I beg you for your guidance!$"
msgstr ""
"哇啊啊！\n"
"{PLAYER}拒绝我了……\l"
"这……这真是宝贵的经验！\p"
"{PLAYER}，拜托了！这次我想\n"
"听到肯定的答复！\p"
"恳请你指导我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:385
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode8"
msgid ""
"Hieeeeh! {PLAYER} said yes!\n"
"{PLAYER} said yes!\p"
"I won't be able to sleep tonight…\n"
"Thank you ever so much!\p"
"Then, here's my question!\p"
"At the BATTLE TOWER, what is right\n"
"for me, Level 50 or Open Level?$"
msgstr ""
"咿呀！{PLAYER}答应了！\n"
"{PLAYER}答应了！\p"
"今晚我要睡不着了……\n"
"真是太感谢你了！\p"
"那么，我的问题来了！\p"
"在对战塔，Lv.50和自由等级，\n"
"哪个适合我呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:394
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks8"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}! Perfectly understood!\n"
"I understand perfectly!\l"
"I'm deliriously delighted!\p"
"I hope you'll be willing to teach me\n"
"some more another time.$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}！完全明白了！\n"
"我完全明白了！\l"
"我高兴得快发疯了！\p"
"希望下次你还愿意\n"
"再多教我一些。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:401
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach9"
msgid ""
"Whoa! Could you be…\n"
"Might you be… {PLAYER}{KUN}?!\l"
"That strong and famous TRAINER?\l"
"Well, hello, aren't I just the luckiest!\p"
"Hello, the name's {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I've been on the lookout for\n"
"a POKéMON teacher.\p"
"And with impeccably good timing,\n"
"along came you, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"So, there you have it, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Let me apprentice under you!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！难道你是……\n"
"莫非你是……{PLAYER}{KUN}？！\l"
"那位又强又有名的训练家？\l"
"哎呀，你好，我真是太走运了！\p"
"你好，我叫{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我一直在找\n"
"一位宝可梦老师。\p"
"结果时机刚刚好，\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}你就出现了！\p"
"所以就这么定了，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"让我拜你为师吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:414
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching9"
msgid ""
"Gwaaaah!\n"
"You're quite cool and tough…\p"
"Don't be that way, please.\n"
"I'm asking you!$"
msgstr ""
"呜哇啊啊！\n"
"你真是又酷又强硬……\p"
"别这样嘛，拜托。\n"
"我在求你啊！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:420
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode9"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! That's a solid reply!\n"
"Excellent, I might add!\p"
"So how about a first piece of advice\n"
"on the BATTLE TOWER?\p"
"If I were to go, what would be better?\n"
"Level 50 or Open Level?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，耶！回答得真干脆！\n"
"我还得说，太棒了！\p"
"那么第一个建议，\n"
"就关于对战塔吧？\p"
"如果我要去，哪个比较好？\n"
"Lv.50还是自由等级？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:428
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks9"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh, {STR_VAR_1} it is!\n"
"OK, A-OK!\l"
"I'll go show my mettle, like, jam!\p"
"All right, I'll look to you as my mentor!\n"
"Adios!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯哼，就{STR_VAR_1}了！\n"
"OK，没问题！\l"
"我要去大展身手，就像，砰！\p"
"好啦，我就把你当我的导师了！\n"
"Adios！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:435
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach10"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}, right?\n"
"The police were looking for you!\p"
"… … …\n"
"Of course I'm lying!\p"
"Me, I'm {STR_VAR_1}. Despite the way\n"
"I look, I'm the POKéMON CHAMPION!\l"
"…That's a lie, too!\p"
"This is no lie, though.\n"
"I'm not very good at battling.\p"
"So, how about you becoming my master\n"
"about all things POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，嘿，你是{PLAYER}{KUN}对吧？\n"
"警察正在找你呢！\p"
"…… …… ……\n"
"当然是骗你的！\p"
"我叫{STR_VAR_1}。别看我这样，\n"
"我可是宝可梦冠军！\l"
"……这也是骗你的！\p"
"不过这次不是骗人的。\n"
"我不太擅长对战。\p"
"所以，你愿不愿意\n"
"当我宝可梦方面的师父？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:448
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching10"
msgid ""
"If you're going to act cold like that,\n"
"I'll show you what I'll do!\p"
"Waaah! Waaah! Waaah!\n"
"Hiccup!\p"
"Hahaha, that was my FAKE TEARS!\p"
"Come on, will you please be\n"
"my POKéMON master?$"
msgstr ""
"你要是那么冷淡的话，\n"
"我就让你看看我的厉害！\p"
"哇啊！哇啊！哇啊！\n"
"嗝！\p"
"哈哈哈，那是我的假哭！\p"
"拜托嘛，你愿意当\n"
"我的宝可梦师父吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:457
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode10"
msgid ""
"Yippee!\n"
"I'll buy you a boat for that!\p"
"Of course I'm lying again!\n"
"But… Thank you, master!\p"
"You know how there's Level 50 and\n"
"Open Level at the BATTLE TOWER?\p"
"I'm having trouble deciding which\n"
"level I should challenge…\p"
"Can you decide for me, master?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！\n"
"为了这个我要送你一艘船！\p"
"当然又是骗你的！\n"
"不过……谢谢你，师父！\p"
"你知道对战塔有Lv.50\n"
"和自由等级吧？\p"
"我很犹豫\n"
"该挑战哪个等级……\p"
"师父，你能帮我决定吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:468
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks10"
msgid ""
"Okay, so {STR_VAR_1} is better!\n"
"I'll go to the other level, then!\p"
"Just kidding!\n"
"I'll obey your teaching, master!\p"
"Thanks, master!\n"
"I hope you'll keep teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"好，那就是{STR_VAR_1}比较好！\n"
"那我就去另一个等级了！\p"
"开玩笑的啦！\n"
"我会听师父的教导的！\p"
"谢谢师父！\n"
"希望你继续教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:476
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach11"
msgid ""
"A-H-O-Y!\n"
"And that spells ahoy, and it means hi!\p"
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}, the rappin' SAILOR\n"
"am I!\p"
"Your turn now, tell me a little about\n"
"yourself, give it a try!\p"
"Uh-huh, uh-huh!\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}'s your name,\l"
"and POKéMON's your game!\p"
"And you're at a delicate age\n"
"when all the world's your stage!\p"
"Anyway, I just want to say,\n"
"that you're the tenth TRAINER\l"
"I've spoken to today.\p"
"Let's make that a celebration!\n"
"Become my mentor for commemoration!$"
msgstr ""
"A-H-O-Y！\n"
"拼起来就是“啊嗨”，意思是你好！\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"会说唱的水手就是我！\p"
"现在轮到你，说说你自己，\n"
"来试试看，别客气！\p"
"嗯哼，嗯哼！\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}就是你的名，\l"
"宝可梦就是你的行！\p"
"你正处在微妙的年纪，\n"
"整个世界都是你的舞台戏！\p"
"总之我只想说一句，\n"
"你是我今天搭话的\l"
"第十个训练家！\p"
"我们来庆祝一下吧！\n"
"当我的导师留作纪念吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:494
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching11"
msgid ""
"But!\n"
"You have to work with me!\p"
"Don't be such a tease!\n"
"Become my mentor, please!$"
msgstr ""
"可是！\n"
"你得跟我合作才行！\p"
"别再逗我了！\n"
"当我的导师吧，求你啦！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:500
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode11"
msgid ""
"That's it!\n"
"{PLAYER}, you've got the spirit!\p"
"So here's my first question\n"
"that begs your suggestion!\p"
"It's about the BATTLE TOWER,\n"
"and it hinges on my power!\p"
"Level 50 and Open Level there be,\n"
"which is the one that's good for me?$"
msgstr ""
"就是这样！\n"
"{PLAYER}，你真有精神！\p"
"那我的第一个问题，\n"
"要请你给点建议！\p"
"关于对战塔的事情，\n"
"关系到我的实力！\p"
"Lv.50和自由等级在那里，\n"
"哪个适合我，请告诉你徒弟！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:510
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks11"
msgid ""
"Okay, {STR_VAR_1} it is, you say!\n"
"I'll go and take it on my way!\p"
"If it's advice I ever need,\n"
"{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"
msgstr ""
"好，你说就选{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"我这就出发去挑战一次！\p"
"如果以后需要建议，\n"
"{PLAYER}，你的话我一定牢记！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:516
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach12"
msgid ""
"Say, hey, aren't you {PLAYER}?\n"
"What should I do? Talk to you?\l"
"Why not? I'm already talking to you!\p"
"{PLAYER}, are you surprised at me?\n"
"I'd better tell you who I happen to be!\p"
"{STR_VAR_1} is what you can call me.\n"
"The brightest star in guitardom,\l"
"that's me!\p"
"Are you receiving me?\n"
"You are receiving me!\p"
"My luck's at its best,\n"
"I'll hit you with a request!\p"
"{PLAYER}, let me be your underling!\n"
"I want you to teach me everything!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，你不就是{PLAYER}吗？\n"
"我该怎么办？跟你说话？\l"
"有何不可？我已经在跟你说话啦！\p"
"{PLAYER}，你被我吓到了吗？\n"
"我最好告诉你我是谁吧！\p"
"你可以叫我{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"吉他界最闪亮的明星，\l"
"就是我！\p"
"你收到了吗？\n"
"你收到我了！\p"
"我的运气正好，\n"
"要向你提个请求！\p"
"{PLAYER}，让我当你的小弟！\n"
"我要你教我所有的一切！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:532
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching12"
msgid ""
"You're turning me down, then?\n"
"I'll just have to ask you again!\p"
"{PLAYER}, I beg to be your underling!\n"
"I need you to teach me everything!$"
msgstr ""
"你要拒绝我吗？\n"
"那我只好再求你一次！\p"
"{PLAYER}，求你让我当你的小弟！\n"
"我需要你教我所有的一切！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:538
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode12"
msgid ""
"Lucky, yeah, woohoo!\n"
"Should I pop a question to you?\p"
"Since we're near the BATTLE TOWER,\n"
"how about a question about its power?\p"
"Of the choices you see,\n"
"which is the right one for me?$"
msgstr ""
"走运啦，耶，呜呼！\n"
"要不要问你个问题呢？\p"
"既然我们就在对战塔旁，\n"
"就问问关于它的事情吧？\p"
"在你看到的选项里，\n"
"哪个才是最适合我的？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:546
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks12"
msgid ""
"If {STR_VAR_1} is what you suggest,\n"
"it must be the very best!\p"
"Well, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\n"
"but don't you forget about me.\p"
"See you again, my smart friend!$"
msgstr ""
"既然你推荐{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"那它一定是最好的！\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}，我要去流浪了，\n"
"可是别把我忘了哦。\p"
"再见啦，我聪明的朋友！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:553
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach13"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi! You there!\n"
"Can I get you to massage my shoulder?\p"
"…Yes, there! That's it!\n"
"Ouch, ouch! Oooh, that feels great!\p"
"My name's {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"I take karate training, but my body's\l"
"not built to take the abuse…\p"
"I decided I'll battle POKéMON and\n"
"toughen myself up.\p"
"You're {PLAYER}{KUN}, aren't you?\n"
"The POKéMON LEAGUE CHAMP?\p"
"Listen, can I get you to give me\n"
"advice?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，你好！就是你！\n"
"能帮我按摩一下肩膀吗？\p"
"……对，就是那里！就是那样！\n"
"痛痛痛！噢——好舒服！\p"
"我叫{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"我在练空手道，可是我的身体\l"
"受不了那种折磨……\p"
"所以我决定用宝可梦对战\n"
"来锻炼自己。\p"
"你是{PLAYER}{KUN}对吧？\n"
"宝可梦联盟的冠军？\p"
"听着，能请你\n"
"给我一些建议吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:568
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching13"
msgid ""
"Oh, why?\p"
"I won't be a big bother, I promise!\n"
"Please?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，为什么？\p"
"我保证不会给你添麻烦的！\n"
"拜托了？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:573
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode13"
msgid ""
"Thank you. Mighty good of you!\n"
"…Cough! Cough!\p"
"Oogh, I have to toughen up quick…\p"
"I'll be heading off to the BATTLE TOWER\n"
"right away, but what would be better\l"
"for me? Level 50 or Open Level?$"
msgstr ""
"谢谢你，你真是个好人！\n"
"……咳！咳！\p"
"呜，我得赶快变强才行……\p"
"我马上就要去对战塔了，\n"
"可是哪个比较适合我呢？\l"
"Lv.50还是自由等级？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:581
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks13"
msgid ""
"Hm, all right. That's {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"I'll go there right away.\p"
"I hope I can keep hitting you up for\n"
"help--after all, you're my mentor!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，好的。就是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"我马上就去。\p"
"希望以后还能继续找你帮忙，\n"
"毕竟你是我的导师嘛！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:587
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach14"
msgid ""
"Er… Um…\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}…?\p"
"Please, don't look at me that way.\n"
"You're making me all self-conscious.\p"
"I… I'm {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I'm really embarrassed to say this,\n"
"but I explore ancient ruins and such.\p"
"I'm even more embarrassed to admit\n"
"I'm interested in the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, you have a reputation as\n"
"a tough TRAINER…\p"
"It's hard for me to say this,\n"
"but I want to ask something.\p"
"Could you become my teacher and\n"
"give me advice?$"
msgstr ""
"呃……那个……\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}……？\p"
"拜托，别那样看着我。\n"
"你让我很不自在。\p"
"我……我叫{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"说出来真不好意思，\n"
"我是探索古代遗迹之类的人。\p"
"更不好意思承认的是，\n"
"我对对战开拓区很感兴趣。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，听说你是\n"
"一位很强的训练家……\p"
"这话我很难说出口，\n"
"但我想拜托你一件事。\p"
"你能当我的老师，\n"
"给我一些建议吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:604
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching14"
msgid ""
"Please don't brush me off like this!\n"
"I can't live with the humiliation.\p"
"Please become my teacher!\n"
"I need your advice!$"
msgstr ""
"拜托别这样拒绝我！\n"
"我受不了这种羞辱。\p"
"请当我的老师吧！\n"
"我需要你的建议！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:610
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode14"
msgid ""
"Th-thank you…\p"
"But please don't look at me like that.\n"
"It makes me all flustered.\p"
"Please, answer me without looking\n"
"at my eyes.\p"
"At the BATTLE TOWER…\n"
"Which level should I attempt?$"
msgstr ""
"谢、谢谢你……\p"
"不过请别那样看着我。\n"
"我会很慌张的。\p"
"拜托，回答我的时候\n"
"别看着我的眼睛。\p"
"在对战塔……\n"
"我应该挑战哪个等级呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:619
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks14"
msgid ""
"Oh… Okay!\n"
"I'll try my hand at that.\p"
"I hope I can make a valiant challenge\n"
"without getting all flustered…\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"If we meet again, I hope you will be\l"
"as helpful.$"
msgstr ""
"啊……好的！\n"
"我会去试试看。\p"
"希望我能不慌不忙地\n"
"勇敢挑战……\p"
"谢谢你，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"如果我们再见面，\l"
"希望你还能这样帮我。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:628
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePleaseTeach15"
msgid ""
"Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"But are you really real?\p"
"You may call me {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I have been toying with the idea of\n"
"apprenticing under a strong TRAINER.\p"
"So, I must say I'm lucky you came along!\n"
"…You really are {PLAYER}{KUN}, yes?\p"
"No, no, if you are real, it's fine.\n"
"I merely want you to recognize me\l"
"as your apprentice.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？你看起来像是{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"但你真的是本人吗？\p"
"你可以叫我{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我一直在考虑\n"
"拜一位强大的训练家为师。\p"
"所以说，你能出现真是我的运气！\n"
"……你真的是{PLAYER}{KUN}，对吧？\p"
"不，不，如果你是真的就好。\n"
"我只是想请你\l"
"收我为徒。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:640
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeRejectTeaching15"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"But what would compel you to refuse?\p"
"I apologize for being skeptical about\n"
"your identity.\p"
"Please accept my apology and\n"
"accept me as your apprentice.$"
msgstr ""
"噢？\n"
"你为什么要拒绝呢？\p"
"我为怀疑你的身份\n"
"向你道歉。\p"
"请接受我的道歉，\n"
"并收我为徒吧。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:648
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichLevelMode15"
msgid ""
"You really are accepting me?\n"
"I don't wish to celebrate prematurely.\p"
"If it is true, I apologize.\n"
"But now, I need your advice.\p"
"If I were to enter the BATTLE TOWER,\n"
"what would be worthy of me?\l"
"Level 50 or Open Level?$"
msgstr ""
"你真的愿意收我吗？\n"
"我可不想高兴得太早。\p"
"如果是真的，那我很抱歉。\n"
"不过现在，我需要你的建议。\p"
"如果我要挑战对战塔，\n"
"哪个才配得上我呢？\l"
"Lv.50还是自由等级？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:657
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeLevelModeThanks15"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Are you certain?\p"
"I see. If that's the case, that's fine.\n"
"I thank you for your time.\p"
"I realize I can annoy, but it delights\n"
"me that you have accepted me.\p"
"Let us meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"你确定吗？\p"
"我明白了。既然如此，那就好。\n"
"谢谢你抽出时间。\p"
"我知道我可能很烦人，但你能\n"
"接纳我，我真的很高兴。\p"
"我们再见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:666
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem0"
msgid ""
"Sigh… Sob…\n"
"Oh, {PLAYER}!\p"
"I'm all tangled up in a dilemma\n"
"that I can't decide.\p"
"I can't decide what I should make\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} hold.\p"
"Please tell me, {PLAYER}.\n"
"What item should I make it hold?$"
msgstr ""
"唉……呜呜……\n"
"啊，{PLAYER}！\p"
"我陷入了两难，\n"
"怎么也决定不了。\p"
"我不知道该让我的\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}携带什么。\p"
"请告诉我吧，{PLAYER}。\n"
"我该让它携带什么道具呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:676
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing0"
msgid ""
"Oh, really? I shouldn't make\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，真的吗？我不该让\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}携带任何东西？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:680
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem0"
msgid ""
"Oh, okay! I'm delighted it's settled!\n"
"Awesome! Wicked! Awoooh!\p"
"Thank you so much!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，好的！终于决定了，我好高兴！\n"
"太棒了！太酷了！嗷呜——！\p"
"真的非常感谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:685
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem0"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm so glad…\n"
"I think I have that {STR_VAR_1}, too.\p"
"I'm delighted it's settled!\n"
"Awesome! Wicked! Awoooh!\p"
"Thank you so much!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，太好了……\n"
"我好像也有{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"终于决定了，我好高兴！\n"
"太棒了！太酷了！嗷呜——！\p"
"真的非常感谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:692
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended0"
msgid ""
"Waaaah! Please don't be mean!\p"
"That item {STR_VAR_1} was already\n"
"recommended to me before, sob…\p"
"Or do you mean I shouldn't make\n"
"my {STR_VAR_2} hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"哇啊啊！请不要捉弄我！\p"
"那个{STR_VAR_1}之前已经\n"
"有人推荐给我了，呜呜……\p"
"还是说，你是指我不该让\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}携带任何东西？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:699
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem1"
msgid ""
"Yay! It's {PLAYER}!\n"
"Great! I wanted to ask you something!\p"
"Do you make your POKéMON hold items?\n"
"I want to make mine hold items, but…\p"
"What item would be good for\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} to hold?\p"
"What do you think?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！是{PLAYER}！\n"
"太好了！我正想问你事情！\p"
"你会让宝可梦携带道具吗？\n"
"我也想让我的宝可梦带道具，可是……\p"
"让{STR_VAR_1}携带\n"
"什么道具比较好呢？\p"
"你觉得呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:708
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing1"
msgid ""
"Huh? You mean my {STR_VAR_1} doesn't\n"
"have to hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"咦？你是说我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"什么都不用带？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:712
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem1"
msgid ""
"Oh, I get it! I'll do that!\n"
"Thanks for teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"噢，我懂了！我会照做的！\n"
"谢谢你教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:716
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem1"
msgid ""
"Oh, wow! One {STR_VAR_1}, huh?\n"
"Okay, I'll do that!\p"
"Thanks for teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！一个{STR_VAR_1}是吧？\n"
"好，我会照做的！\p"
"谢谢你教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:721
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended1"
msgid ""
"Oh, uh, no, that's not what I meant.\n"
"I want to know about a different item\l"
"than the ones I already know.\p"
"Or do you mean that my POKéMON doesn't\n"
"have to hold anything this time?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，呃，不是，我不是那个意思。\n"
"我想知道的是\l"
"我还不知道的其他道具。\p"
"还是说，这次我的宝可梦\n"
"什么都不用带？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:728
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem2"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, hello!\n"
"It's about my {STR_VAR_1}…\p"
"I want to make it hold a good item.\n"
"What would be good for it?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，你好！\n"
"是关于我的{STR_VAR_1}的事……\p"
"我想让它携带好的道具。\n"
"什么道具比较适合它呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:734
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing2"
msgid ""
"Oh, then my {STR_VAR_1} doesn't have\n"
"to hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，那我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"什么都不用带吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:738
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem2"
msgid ""
"Okay, I got it!\n"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"好的，我明白了！\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:742
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem2"
msgid ""
"Oh, the item {STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Understood!\p"
"I'll do my best to find one!\n"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{STR_VAR_1}这个道具吗？\n"
"明白了！\p"
"我会努力找到一个的！\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:748
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended2"
msgid ""
"Somebody taught me about\n"
"the {STR_VAR_1} already.\p"
"I want my POKéMON to hold a different\n"
"kind of item.\p"
"Or do you think {STR_VAR_2} doesn't\n"
"have to hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"已经有人告诉过我\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的事了。\p"
"我想让我的宝可梦\n"
"携带别的道具。\p"
"还是说，你觉得{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"什么都不用带？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:756
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem3"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}…\n"
"I'm sorry to disturb you, but I have\l"
"something else I wanted to ask you.\p"
"I don't think I'm good enough to win\n"
"matches on my own, so I'm thinking of\l"
"making my {STR_VAR_1} hold an item.\p"
"But I don't know what would be good.\p"
"{PLAYER}, please, could you decide\n"
"for me?$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}……\n"
"抱歉打扰你，\l"
"我还有别的事想问你。\p"
"我觉得我自己赢不了比赛，\n"
"所以我在考虑\l"
"让我的{STR_VAR_1}携带道具。\p"
"可是我不知道什么比较好。\p"
"{PLAYER}，拜托，\n"
"你能帮我决定吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:767
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing3"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON belonging to someone like me\n"
"would be better off without an item?$"
msgstr ""
"像我这样的人的宝可梦，\n"
"还是不带道具比较好吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:771
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem3"
msgid ""
"I understand…\n"
"You're saying I shouldn't rely on items.\l"
"I'll do my best not to!\p"
"Thank you very much!$"
msgstr ""
"我明白了……\n"
"你是说我不该依赖道具。\l"
"我会努力不去依赖的！\p"
"非常感谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:777
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem3"
msgid ""
"The item {STR_VAR_1}, okay.\n"
"I'm not sure if I can get one…\l"
"No! I'll do my best to get it.\p"
"Thank you very much!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}这个道具，好的。\n"
"我不确定能不能弄到……\l"
"不！我会努力弄到手的。\p"
"非常感谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:783
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended3"
msgid ""
"Oh, but…\n"
"I think I've heard about that before…\p"
"Is it maybe because I haven't handled\n"
"the item {STR_VAR_1} very well?\p"
"Or do you mean I shouldn't make\n"
"my {STR_VAR_2} hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，可是……\n"
"我好像以前听说过……\p"
"是不是因为我没用好\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}这个道具呢？\p"
"还是说，你是指我不该让\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}携带任何东西？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:791
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem4"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"There's something I wanted to ask you.\p"
"You know how you decided which\n"
"POKéMON I should have for me?\p"
"But I never asked you what item\n"
"it should be holding.\p"
"Since you already gave me advice,\n"
"how about seeing this to the end?\p"
"What would be good? I want to make\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} hold something.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我有件事想问你。\p"
"你还记得你帮我决定\n"
"该用哪只宝可梦吗？\p"
"可是我从没问过你\n"
"它应该携带什么道具。\p"
"既然你已经给过我建议了，\n"
"那就帮人帮到底吧？\p"
"什么比较好呢？我想让\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}携带点东西。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:803
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing4"
msgid ""
"Oh! So my {STR_VAR_1} should do\n"
"the best it can empty-handed?$"
msgstr ""
"啊！所以我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"应该空着手尽力而为？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:807
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem4"
msgid ""
"If you think that's best, I'll do that.\p"
"Knowing that you made the decision,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\l"
"I lose.\p"
"Okay, I'll look to you for advice again.\n"
"Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"如果你觉得那样最好，我就照做。\p"
"既然是{PLAYER}{KUN}帮我决定的，\n"
"就算输了我也不会太难过。\p"
"好啦，下次再找你请教。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:815
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem4"
msgid ""
"The item {STR_VAR_1}, huh?\n"
"Not bad. I'll use it!\p"
"Knowing that you made the decision,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\l"
"I lose.\p"
"Okay, I'll look to you for advice again.\n"
"Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}这个道具啊？\n"
"还不错嘛。我就用它了！\p"
"既然是{PLAYER}{KUN}帮我决定的，\n"
"就算输了我也不会太难过。\p"
"好啦，下次再找你请教。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:824
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended4"
msgid ""
"Huh? What are you saying?\n"
"You told me about the {STR_VAR_1}\l"
"already before.\p"
"Or do you mean my {STR_VAR_2} should\n"
"do the best it can empty-handed?$"
msgstr ""
"咦？你在说什么啊？\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的事\l"
"你之前就跟我说过了。\p"
"还是说，我的{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"应该空着手尽力而为？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:831
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem5"
msgid ""
"Yo, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"We're both busy, but we seem to run\n"
"into each other often anyway!\p"
"Today I have to do some walking,\n"
"cleaning, and brushing.\p"
"I haven't even had the time to buy\n"
"my precious {STR_VAR_1} anything.\p"
"I don't have any time, so how about\n"
"giving me advice on what I should make\l"
"my {STR_VAR_1} hold?$"
msgstr ""
"哟，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"我们都很忙，\n"
"但好像还是经常碰面嘛！\p"
"今天我得去散步、\n"
"打扫，还得刷毛。\p"
"我连给我宝贵的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"买东西的时间都没有。\p"
"我没时间了，所以你能不能\n"
"给我点建议，告诉我该让\l"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}携带什么？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:843
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing5"
msgid ""
"Oh, so me being a busy guy, you say\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} doesn't need anything?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，所以你是说我这么忙，\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}什么都不需要？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:847
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem5"
msgid ""
"Okay, gotcha.\n"
"I won't need any time for that.\p"
"Thanks today!\n"
"See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"好，明白了。\n"
"这样我就不用花时间了。\p"
"今天谢啦！\n"
"回头见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:853
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem5"
msgid ""
"Okay, gotcha.\n"
"I'll find time somehow and find\l"
"that {STR_VAR_1} you recommended.\p"
"I'm glad I met a good mentor in you.\n"
"Thanks! See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"好，明白了。\n"
"我会想办法挤出时间，\l"
"去找你推荐的{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"能遇到你这么好的导师，我很高兴。\n"
"谢啦！回头见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:860
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended5"
msgid ""
"Huh? I already know about\n"
"that {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Oh, right, I get it.\n"
"So me being a busy guy, you say\l"
"my {STR_VAR_2} doesn't need anything?$"
msgstr ""
"咦？{STR_VAR_1}的事\n"
"我已经知道了。\p"
"噢，对了，我懂了。\n"
"所以你是说我这么忙，\l"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}什么都不需要？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:867
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem6"
msgid ""
"Hiya, {PLAYER}! It's me!\n"
"I need to tap your mind again today.\l"
"Please, I need your advice!\p"
"Drum roll, please!\n"
"The question I have is…\p"
"If I want to make my {STR_VAR_1} hold\n"
"an item, what should it be?$"
msgstr ""
"嗨，{PLAYER}！是我！\n"
"今天我又要借用你的智慧了。\l"
"拜托，我需要你的建议！\p"
"请来点鼓声！\n"
"我的问题是……\p"
"如果我想让{STR_VAR_1}携带道具，\n"
"应该带什么呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:876
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing6"
msgid ""
"Is that right? My {STR_VAR_1} doesn't\n"
"need to hold an item, you're saying.$"
msgstr ""
"是这样吗？你是说我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"不需要携带道具。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:880
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem6"
msgid ""
"Okay, that's what I'll do!\p"
"I guess that's about all I wanted\n"
"to ask you today.\p"
"Let's meet here again, okay?\n"
"Thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"好，那我就这么做！\p"
"我今天想问的\n"
"大概就这些了。\p"
"我们下次再在这里见面吧？\n"
"谢谢！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:887
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem6"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh! One {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"What a cool choice!\l"
"I'll definitely try that!\p"
"I guess that's about all I wanted\n"
"to ask you today.\p"
"Let's meet here again, okay?\n"
"Thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯嗯！一个{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"真是个酷炫的选择！\l"
"我一定会试试的！\p"
"我今天想问的\n"
"大概就这些了。\p"
"我们下次再在这里见面吧？\n"
"谢谢！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:896
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended6"
msgid ""
"Ahahah! That's silly!\n"
"You already told me about that\l"
"{STR_VAR_1} before!\p"
"Are you feeling okay, {PLAYER}?\p"
"Oh, wait! My {STR_VAR_2} doesn't\n"
"need to hold an item, you're saying.$"
msgstr ""
"啊哈哈！好傻哦！\n"
"你之前已经跟我说过\l"
"{STR_VAR_1}了！\p"
"你还好吗，{PLAYER}？\p"
"啊，等等！你是说我的{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"不需要携带道具。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:904
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem7"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}. I hope you've been\n"
"keeping well.\p"
"May I approach you for advice?\p"
"In a recent battle, my opponent\n"
"seemed to have given his POKéMON\l"
"an item to hold.\p"
"As a result, I was defeated…\p"
"I don't wish to be left behind.\n"
"I would like to make my {STR_VAR_1}\l"
"hold an item, too.\p"
"It would please me if you could decide\n"
"what would be right for my POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""
"您好，{PLAYER}。\n"
"希望您一切安好。\p"
"我可以向您请教吗？\p"
"在最近的一场对战中，\n"
"对手似乎让他的宝可梦\l"
"携带了道具。\p"
"结果，我输了……\p"
"我不想落后于人。\n"
"我也想让我的{STR_VAR_1}\l"
"携带道具。\p"
"如果您能帮我决定适合\n"
"我宝可梦的道具，我会很高兴……$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:918
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing7"
msgid ""
"In other words… My POKéMON has\n"
"no need to hold an item?$"
msgstr ""
"也就是说……我的宝可梦\n"
"不需要携带道具吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:922
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem7"
msgid ""
"I understand clearly now!\n"
"I will keep trying like this.\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I hope I can count on you again.\l"
"Please take care!$"
msgstr ""
"我现在完全明白了！\n"
"我会继续这样努力的。\p"
"谢谢您，{PLAYER}。\n"
"希望以后还能仰仗您。\l"
"请多保重！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:929
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem7"
msgid ""
"One {STR_VAR_1} it is!\n"
"I will order it right away.\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I hope I can count on you again.\l"
"Please take care!$"
msgstr ""
"就是{STR_VAR_1}了！\n"
"我马上去订购。\p"
"谢谢您，{PLAYER}。\n"
"希望以后还能仰仗您。\l"
"请多保重！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:936
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended7"
msgid ""
"You've already told me about that,\n"
"and I already have it.\p"
"Or are you saying… My POKéMON has\n"
"no need to hold an item?$"
msgstr ""
"这个您已经跟我说过了，\n"
"而且我已经有了。\p"
"还是说……我的宝可梦\n"
"不需要携带道具吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:942
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem8"
msgid ""
"Eek! {PLAYER}!\n"
"I… I'm overjoyed to see you again!\p"
"Oh-oh-oh! There's something I just\n"
"had to ask you, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Please decide what my {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"should be holding!$"
msgstr ""
"呀！{PLAYER}！\n"
"我……能再见到你，我高兴死了！\p"
"噢噢噢！我有件事\n"
"一定要问你，{PLAYER}！\p"
"请帮我决定我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"应该携带什么！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:950
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing8"
msgid ""
"Oh, wow! I didn't expect that answer!\n"
"So, a hold item isn't necessary?$"
msgstr ""
"哇！没想到是这个答案！\n"
"所以，不需要携带道具吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:954
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem8"
msgid ""
"Perfectly understood!\n"
"I'll keep at this without an item!\p"
"I hope you'll be willing to teach me\n"
"some more another time.$"
msgstr ""
"完全明白了！\n"
"我会不带道具继续努力的！\p"
"希望下次你还愿意\n"
"再多教我一些。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:960
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem8"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}! I'll use that!\p"
"Um… Could it be, {PLAYER}, you also\n"
"make your POKéMON hold that item?\p"
"I'll be sure to get it!\n"
"I hope you'll be willing to teach me\l"
"some more another time.$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}！我就用那个！\p"
"嗯……难道说，{PLAYER}，\n"
"你也让你的宝可梦带着那个道具？\p"
"我一定会弄到手的！\n"
"希望下次你还愿意\l"
"再多教我一些。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:968
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended8"
msgid ""
"Oh? You recommended that\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} before, too.\p"
"Or is it the best thing to hold?\n"
"Or do you mean that my {STR_VAR_2}\l"
"doesn't need anything to hold?$"
msgstr ""
"噢？你之前也推荐过\n"
"那个{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"还是说它就是最好的携带物？\n"
"还是说，你是指我的{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"不需要携带任何东西？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:975
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem9"
msgid ""
"Hola!\n"
"My maestro, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I want to hit you up for advice on\n"
"POKéMON tools.\p"
"What do you think would be good for\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} to hold?\p"
"Don't be shy now.\n"
"Let's blurt it out!$"
msgstr ""
"Hola！\n"
"我的大师，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"我想向你请教\n"
"宝可梦道具的事。\p"
"你觉得我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"带什么比较好？\p"
"别害羞嘛。\n"
"直接说出来吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:985
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing9"
msgid ""
"Oh? So, you're saying my {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"can win without holding any item?$"
msgstr ""
"噢？所以你是说我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"不带任何道具也能赢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:989
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem9"
msgid ""
"Si, bueno!\n"
"I'll give it my best shot, like, slam!\p"
"All right, thanks, as always!\n"
"Adios!$"
msgstr ""
"Si，bueno！\n"
"我会全力以赴的，就像，砰！\p"
"好啦，一如既往地谢谢你！\n"
"Adios！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:995
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem9"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh, that's one {STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Si, bueno!\l"
"I'll go find me one, like, bam!\p"
"All right, thanks, as always!\n"
"Adios!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯哼，就是一个{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"Si，bueno！\l"
"我这就去找一个来，就像，砰！\p"
"好啦，一如既往地谢谢你！\n"
"Adios！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1002
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended9"
msgid ""
"No, no! You already told me about\n"
"that {STR_VAR_1} thing before.\p"
"Oh, now wait just one minute here…\n"
"So, you're saying my {STR_VAR_2}\l"
"can win without holding any item?$"
msgstr ""
"不对不对！你之前已经跟我说过\n"
"那个{STR_VAR_1}了。\p"
"噢，等一下……\n"
"所以你是说我的{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"不带任何道具也能赢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1009
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem10"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, something unbelievable\n"
"has happened!\p"
"I woke up this morning, and my POKéMON\n"
"had 10 NUGGETS!\p"
"Of course I'm lying!\n"
"Wahahaha!\p"
"This is no lie, though.\n"
"I'm not very good at thinking about\l"
"what items POKéMON should hold.\p"
"So, how about deciding for me what\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} should hold, master?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，发生了一件\n"
"不可思议的事！\p"
"我今天早上醒来，我的宝可梦\n"
"竟然有10个金珠！\p"
"当然是骗你的！\n"
"哇哈哈哈！\p"
"不过这次不是骗人的。\n"
"我不太擅长思考\l"
"宝可梦该携带什么道具。\p"
"所以，师父，你能帮我决定\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}该携带什么吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1022
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing10"
msgid ""
"What's that mean?\n"
"Don't make it hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"什么意思？\n"
"不让它带任何东西？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1026
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem10"
msgid ""
"Okay, so it shouldn't hold anything.\n"
"Then, I'd better get something for it!\p"
"Just kidding!\n"
"I'll obey your teaching, master!\p"
"Thanks, master!\n"
"I hope you'll keep teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"好，所以它不该带任何东西。\n"
"那我得赶快给它弄点东西了！\p"
"开玩笑的啦！\n"
"我会听师父的教导的！\p"
"谢谢师父！\n"
"希望你继续教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1034
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem10"
msgid ""
"Okay, so it's one {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"I'll make it hold anything but that!\p"
"Just kidding!\n"
"I'll obey your teaching, master!\p"
"Thanks, master!\n"
"I hope you'll keep teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"好，所以是一个{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我会让它带除了那个以外的东西！\p"
"开玩笑的啦！\n"
"我会听师父的教导的！\p"
"谢谢师父！\n"
"希望你继续教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1042
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended10"
msgid ""
"Um, you told me about that before,\n"
"didn't you?\p"
"Isn't there something else?\p"
"Or do you mean, don't make\n"
"my {STR_VAR_2} hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，那个你之前跟我说过了，\n"
"对吧？\p"
"没有别的了吗？\p"
"还是说，你是指别让\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}带任何东西？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1049
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem11"
msgid ""
"A-H-O-Y!\n"
"And that spells ahoy!\p"
"The rappin' SAILOR am I!\n"
"I present to you a question\l"
"that's pretty fly!\p"
"It's an item question\n"
"that begs your suggestion!\p"
"My {STR_VAR_1} needs an item to hold,\n"
"What should it be, if I may be bold?$"
msgstr ""
"A-H-O-Y！\n"
"拼起来就是“啊嗨”！\p"
"说唱水手就是我！\n"
"我要问你一个问题\l"
"保证酷到不行！\p"
"这是个道具的问题，\n"
"要请你给点建议！\p"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}要带个道具，\n"
"该带什么呢，请你来定夺！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1060
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing11"
msgid ""
"Is that right?\n"
"My {STR_VAR_1} doesn't need to be\l"
"holding anything tight?$"
msgstr ""
"是这样吗？\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}不需要\l"
"紧紧抓着任何东西？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1065
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem11"
msgid ""
"Okay, I hear you, sure I do!\n"
"My POKéMON will go empty-handed, too!\p"
"If it's advice I ever need,\n"
"{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"
msgstr ""
"好，我听到了，当然听到啦！\n"
"我的宝可梦也会空手出发！\p"
"如果以后需要建议，\n"
"{PLAYER}，你的话我一定牢记！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1071
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem11"
msgid ""
"Okay, one {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"that's what I'll use.\l"
"I was right to make you choose!\p"
"If it's advice I ever need,\n"
"{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"
msgstr ""
"好，一个{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"我就用它啦。\l"
"让你来选果然没选错嘛！\p"
"如果以后需要建议，\n"
"{PLAYER}，你的话我一定牢记！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1078
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended11"
msgid ""
"Okay, one {STR_VAR_1}, you say?\n"
"You told me that the other day.\l"
"I need a new idea, a brand new way.\p"
"Or, what, is that right?\n"
"My POKéMON doesn't need to hold\l"
"anything tight?$"
msgstr ""
"好，你说一个{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"那天你已经跟我说过啦。\l"
"我需要新点子，全新的方法。\p"
"还是说，是这样吗？\n"
"我的宝可梦不需要\l"
"紧紧抓着任何东西？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1086
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem12"
msgid ""
"Say, hey, {PLAYER}!\n"
"I found you again today!\p"
"What should I do? Get your advice?\n"
"Why not? I'm already talking to you!\p"
"{PLAYER}, are you getting sick of me?\n"
"Nah, no way, that can't be.\p"
"Will you hear me out?\n"
"I'm looking for advice--that's what\l"
"I'm talking about.\p"
"It's about a hold item for\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} that'd be good.\l"
"My indecision is making me brood.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，嘿，{PLAYER}！\n"
"今天我又找到你啦！\p"
"我该怎么办？问你建议？\n"
"有何不可？我已经在跟你说话啦！\p"
"{PLAYER}，你是不是烦我了？\n"
"不不，不可能，绝对不会的。\p"
"你能听我说说吗？\n"
"我在找建议——\l"
"我说的就是这个。\p"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}该带什么好，\n"
"我拿不定主意，\l"
"犹豫得心里直发毛。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1100
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing12"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1} needs nothing?\n"
"Doesn't need to hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"我的{STR_VAR_1}什么都不需要？\n"
"什么都不用带？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1104
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem12"
msgid ""
"If holding nothing is the best,\n"
"I'll do as you suggest!\p"
"Well, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\n"
"but don't you forget about me.\p"
"See you again, my smart friend!$"
msgstr ""
"如果什么都不带最好，\n"
"我就照你说的做到！\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}，我要去流浪了，\n"
"可是别把我忘了哦。\p"
"再见啦，我聪明的朋友！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1111
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem12"
msgid ""
"If holding that {STR_VAR_1} is\n"
"the best, I'll do as you suggest!\p"
"Well, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\n"
"but don't you forget about me.\p"
"See you again, my smart friend!$"
msgstr ""
"如果带着{STR_VAR_1}最好，\n"
"我就照你说的做到！\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}，我要去流浪了，\n"
"可是别把我忘了哦。\p"
"再见啦，我聪明的朋友！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1118
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended12"
msgid ""
"Haven't I heard about that\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} before?\l"
"I'm certain I have, that's for sure!\p"
"I need a new something!\n"
"Or, my {STR_VAR_2} needs nothing?\l"
"Doesn't need to hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"那个{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"我不是听说过了吗？\l"
"我肯定听过，绝对没错！\p"
"我需要点新东西！\n"
"还是说，我的{STR_VAR_2}什么都不需要？\l"
"什么都不用带？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1126
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem13"
msgid ""
"Gwah! Ouch! {PLAYER}{KUN}, my arm's broken!\n"
"Don't touch it, please!\p"
"I must've broken it while I was trying\n"
"out different hold items with my posse\l"
"of POKéMON.\p"
"So, things being this way,\n"
"I need you to decide for me.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, what do you think would be\n"
"good for my {STR_VAR_1} to hold?$"
msgstr ""
"哇！好痛！{PLAYER}{KUN}，我的手臂断了！\n"
"拜托，别碰它！\p"
"一定是我和我的宝可梦伙伴们\n"
"试各种携带道具的时候\l"
"弄断的。\p"
"所以，既然情况是这样，\n"
"我需要你帮我决定。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你觉得\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}带什么比较好？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1137
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing13"
msgid ""
"Ouch…\p"
"So your suggestion is my {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"doesn't have to hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"好痛……\p"
"所以你的建议是，我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"什么都不用带？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1142
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem13"
msgid ""
"Hm, all right. That would be easier\n"
"for me, the way things are now.\p"
"I hope I can keep hitting you up\n"
"for help like this.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，好的。照现在这个情况，\n"
"这样对我来说也比较轻松。\p"
"希望以后还能\n"
"像这样继续找你帮忙。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1148
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem13"
msgid ""
"Hm, all right. That's one {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"My POKéMON's arm is fine, so I'll make\l"
"it hold that item right away.\p"
"I hope I can keep hitting you up\n"
"for help like this.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，好的。就是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"我宝可梦的手臂没事，\l"
"我马上就让它带上那个道具。\p"
"希望以后还能\n"
"像这样继续找你帮忙。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1155
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended13"
msgid ""
"No, no, you told me about that\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} before, remember?\p"
"How about telling me something\n"
"even better?\p"
"Oh, wait a second.\n"
"So your suggestion is my {STR_VAR_2}\l"
"doesn't have to hold anything?$"
msgstr ""
"不不，那个{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"你之前说过了，记得吗？\p"
"要不要告诉我\n"
"更好的东西？\p"
"噢，等一下。\n"
"所以你的建议是，我的{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"什么都不用带？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1164
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem14"
msgid ""
"Er… Um…\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"Please, don't look at me that way.\n"
"My POKéMON don't have anything.\p"
"I… I'm really embarrassed about this,\n"
"but I really need your advice.\p"
"I can't decide what hold item would\n"
"make my {STR_VAR_1} strong.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, what do you think would\n"
"be good?$"
msgstr ""
"呃……那个……\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}……\p"
"拜托，别那样看着我。\n"
"我的宝可梦什么都没带。\p"
"我……这件事真让我难为情，\n"
"但我真的需要你的建议。\p"
"我决定不了该带什么道具\n"
"才能让我的{STR_VAR_1}变强。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你觉得\n"
"什么比较好呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1176
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing14"
msgid ""
"Oh… Then, you think it would be better\n"
"if my {STR_VAR_1} didn't have an item?$"
msgstr ""
"啊……那你是说，我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"不带道具会比较好吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1180
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem14"
msgid ""
"Oh… Okay!\n"
"I'll go without an item.\p"
"This is nerve-racking, though.\n"
"Wouldn't it be too cool?\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"If we meet again, I hope you will be\l"
"as helpful.$"
msgstr ""
"啊……好的！\n"
"我就不带道具上场。\p"
"不过这还真让人紧张。\n"
"这样会不会太帅了点？\p"
"谢谢你，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"如果我们再见面，\l"
"希望你还能这样帮我。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1189
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem14"
msgid ""
"Oh… Okay!\n"
"I'll go with that {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"This is nerve-racking, though.\n"
"Wouldn't it be too cool?\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"If we meet again, I hope you will be\l"
"as helpful.$"
msgstr ""
"啊……好的！\n"
"我就带着{STR_VAR_1}上场。\p"
"不过这还真让人紧张。\n"
"这样会不会太帅了点？\p"
"谢谢你，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"如果我们再见面，\l"
"希望你还能这样帮我。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1198
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended14"
msgid ""
"B-but I already heard about that.\p"
"Please don't brush me off like this!\n"
"I can't live with the humiliation.\p"
"Oh… Am I jumping to conclusions?\n"
"Do you think it would be better if\l"
"my {STR_VAR_2} didn't have an item?$"
msgstr ""
"可、可是那个我已经听说过了。\p"
"拜托别这样敷衍我！\n"
"我受不了这种羞辱。\p"
"啊……是我想太多了吗？\n"
"你是觉得我的{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"不带道具会比较好吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1206
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhatHeldItem15"
msgid ""
"Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"But are you really?\l"
"Perhaps you're a twin?\p"
"Oh, no, no, no, don't worry!\n"
"If you really are {PLAYER}, please\l"
"forget about my rudeness.\p"
"What I would like is some more of\n"
"your fine advice.\p"
"I have here my {STR_VAR_1} that I wish\n"
"to make hold a convenient item.\p"
"What would be worthy of it?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？你看起来像是{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"但你真的是吗？\l"
"说不定你是双胞胎？\p"
"噢，不不不，别在意！\n"
"如果你真的是{PLAYER}，\l"
"请原谅我的失礼。\p"
"我想再听听\n"
"你的高见。\p"
"我这里有一只{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"我想让它带个方便的道具。\p"
"什么道具才配得上它呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1219
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeHoldNothing15"
msgid ""
"It's better if it held nothing?\n"
"Are you certain?$"
msgstr ""
"什么都不带比较好？\n"
"你确定吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1223
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksNoHeldItem15"
msgid ""
"I see. If that's the case, that's fine.\n"
"I thank you for your time.\p"
"Let us meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"我明白了。既然如此，那就好。\n"
"谢谢你抽出时间。\p"
"我们再见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1228
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeThanksHeldItem15"
msgid ""
"One {STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Are you certain?\p"
"I see. If that's the case, that's fine.\n"
"I thank you for your time.\p"
"I do hope my POKéMON will be able to\n"
"put it to good use.\p"
"Let us meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"一个{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"你确定吗？\p"
"我明白了。既然如此，那就好。\n"
"谢谢你抽出时间。\p"
"希望我的宝可梦\n"
"能好好利用它。\p"
"我们再见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1237
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeItemAlreadyRecommended15"
msgid ""
"No, no, wait a minute.\n"
"I believe you taught me that before.\p"
"I would like you to recommend\n"
"something different this time.\p"
"Perhaps you're suggesting that\n"
"my {STR_VAR_2} should hold nothing?\l"
"Are you certain?$"
msgstr ""
"不不，等一下。\n"
"我记得你以前教过我这个。\p"
"我希望你这次\n"
"推荐点别的东西。\p"
"或许你是在暗示\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}什么都不该带？\l"
"你确定吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1246
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst0"
msgid ""
"Waah, {PLAYER}!\n"
"I have a dilemma, sob…\p"
"I want to begin battling other people,\n"
"but I don't know what to do.\p"
"How should I line up my POKéMON\n"
"so they'll be at their strongest?\p"
"Please tell me, {PLAYER}.\n"
"If you were me, which of these POKéMON\l"
"would you send out first?$"
msgstr ""
"哇啊，{PLAYER}！\n"
"我陷入两难了，呜呜……\p"
"我想开始和别人对战，\n"
"可是不知道该怎么做。\p"
"宝可梦要怎么排顺序，\n"
"才能发挥出最强的实力呢？\p"
"请告诉我吧，{PLAYER}。\n"
"如果你是我，会让这些宝可梦里\l"
"的哪一只先上场呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1257
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks0"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1} should go first?\n"
"Waaaaah!\p"
"Oh! I'm so sorry!\n"
"You've made me happy by choosing\l"
"my first POKéMON, and it's made me cry…\p"
"Thank you so much!$"
msgstr ""
"让我的{STR_VAR_1}先上场？\n"
"哇啊啊啊！\p"
"啊！真对不起！\n"
"你帮我选了第一只宝可梦，\l"
"我太高兴了，就哭出来了……\p"
"真的非常感谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1265
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst1"
msgid ""
"Yay! It's {PLAYER}!\n"
"Great! I wanted to ask you something!\p"
"Um, of my POKéMON, which do you\n"
"think should go out first?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！是{PLAYER}！\n"
"太好了！我正想问你事情！\p"
"嗯，我的宝可梦里，\n"
"你觉得哪只该先上场？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1271
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks1"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1}? That's true.\n"
"Okay, I'll do that!\p"
"Thanks for teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"我的{STR_VAR_1}？说得对。\n"
"好，我会照做的！\p"
"谢谢你教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1276
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst2"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, hello!\p"
"I think, in a battle, it's very important\n"
"which POKéMON comes out first.\p"
"Out of the POKéMON that I have,\n"
"which would be good to send out first?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，你好！\p"
"我觉得在对战中，\n"
"哪只宝可梦先上场非常重要。\p"
"在我拥有的宝可梦里，\n"
"先派哪只出场比较好呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1283
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks2"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1} goes first?\n"
"Okay, I got it!\p"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"让我的{STR_VAR_1}先上场？\n"
"好的，我明白了！\p"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1288
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst3"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}…\n"
"I'm sorry to disturb you again with\l"
"another question.\p"
"I have so little confidence, I don't\n"
"know what I'd do without you, {PLAYER}.\p"
"It may be a waste of time for me to\n"
"even worry about it, but I just can't\l"
"decide something…\p"
"Which of my POKéMON should I send\n"
"out first in a battle?$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}……\n"
"抱歉又拿问题来\l"
"打扰你了。\p"
"我这么没自信，要是没有你，\n"
"{PLAYER}，我都不知道该怎么办。\p"
"也许我连担心这个\n"
"都是在浪费时间，但我就是\l"
"拿不定主意……\p"
"对战的时候，我该先派\n"
"哪只宝可梦出场呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1300
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks3"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Understood!\p"
"I can't believe that you would bother\n"
"to answer my questions so often!\p"
"I'm so grateful that you would even\n"
"speak with me… Thank you!$"
msgstr ""
"我的{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"明白了！\p"
"真不敢相信你会这么常\n"
"抽空回答我的问题！\p"
"你愿意跟我说话我就很感激了……\n"
"谢谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1308
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst4"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}! It's me!\n"
"I'm so glad to see you because I have\l"
"this little problem.\p"
"I can't decide how my POKéMON should\n"
"be lined up. Could you decide for me?\p"
"Oh, you don't need to decide the whole\n"
"party right now.\p"
"How about deciding just the first\n"
"POKéMON for me?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}！是我！\n"
"见到你真好，因为我\l"
"有个小问题。\p"
"我决定不了宝可梦的出场顺序。\n"
"你能帮我决定吗？\p"
"啊，你不用现在就把\n"
"整支队伍都排好。\p"
"只帮我决定第一只\n"
"宝可梦怎么样？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1319
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks4"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1}? That's great!\p"
"Knowing that you made the decision,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\l"
"I lose.\p"
"Okay, I'll look to you for advice again.\n"
"Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"我的{STR_VAR_1}？太好了！\p"
"既然是{PLAYER}{KUN}帮我决定的，\n"
"就算输了我也不会太难过。\p"
"好啦，下次再找你请教。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1327
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst5"
msgid ""
"Hi, my teacher {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"I'm busy again today!\p"
"I have to do some cycling, shopping,\n"
"and humming.\p"
"I haven't even had the time to decide\n"
"how to line up my POKéMON team.\p"
"So, how about checking out my team?\n"
"Which one should go first?$"
msgstr ""
"嗨，我的老师{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我今天又很忙！\p"
"我得去骑车、购物，\n"
"还得哼歌。\p"
"我连决定宝可梦队伍的\n"
"出场顺序的时间都没有。\p"
"所以，帮我看看我的队伍吧？\n"
"哪只该先上场呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1337
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks5"
msgid ""
"Okay, gotcha.\n"
"I have enough time at least to put\l"
"my {STR_VAR_1} at the head of the line!\p"
"Whoops, my girlfriend's waiting!\n"
"Thanks! See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"好，明白了。\n"
"至少我还有时间\l"
"把{STR_VAR_1}排在最前面！\p"
"哎呀，我女朋友在等我了！\n"
"谢啦！回头见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1344
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst6"
msgid ""
"Yoohoo! Hiya, {PLAYER}!\n"
"You always walk around looking tough!\p"
"Listen, I need something from you\n"
"again! It's the usual thing!\p"
"Drum roll, please!\n"
"The question I have is about my team.\p"
"Which POKéMON of mine should be first\n"
"to go out in a battle?$"
msgstr ""
"呦呼！嗨，{PLAYER}！\n"
"你走路总是一副很强的样子！\p"
"听我说，我又有事要找你了！\n"
"还是老样子！\p"
"请来点鼓声！\n"
"我的问题是关于我的队伍。\p"
"对战的时候，我的哪只宝可梦\n"
"应该第一个上场？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1354
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks6"
msgid ""
"Hmhm!\n"
"My {STR_VAR_1}, you say!\l"
"Thanks for a most cool answer!\p"
"I guess that's about all I wanted\n"
"to ask you today.\p"
"Let's meet here again, okay?\n"
"Thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯哼！\n"
"你说我的{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"谢谢你这么酷的回答！\p"
"我今天想问的\n"
"大概就这些了。\p"
"我们下次再在这里见面吧？\n"
"谢谢！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1363
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst7"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for stopping to\n"
"chat with me, {PLAYER}.\p"
"I know I'm taking advantage of your\n"
"kindness, but may I ask for advice?\p"
"I would like you to decide on the order\n"
"of my POKéMON team.\p"
"It would please me if you could decide\n"
"which POKéMON should come first.$"
msgstr ""
"非常感谢您停下来\n"
"和我聊天，{PLAYER}。\p"
"我知道我是在利用您的好意，\n"
"但我可以向您请教吗？\p"
"我想请您帮我决定\n"
"宝可梦队伍的顺序。\p"
"如果您能帮我决定哪只宝可梦\n"
"先上场，我会很高兴的。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1373
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks7"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1} it is!\n"
"I will put it first right away!\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I hope I can count on you again.\l"
"Please take care!$"
msgstr ""
"就是我的{STR_VAR_1}了！\n"
"我马上就把它排在第一个！\p"
"谢谢您，{PLAYER}。\n"
"希望以后还能仰仗您。\l"
"请多保重！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1380
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst8"
msgid ""
"Eek! {PLAYER}!\n"
"I… I'm overjoyed to see you again!\p"
"My POKéMON have become much\n"
"stronger!\p"
"But I don't always win. It seems to\n"
"depend on which POKéMON goes first.\p"
"{PLAYER}, please, I need your help!\p"
"Please decide which of my POKéMON\n"
"should go out first!$"
msgstr ""
"呀！{PLAYER}！\n"
"我……能再见到你，我高兴死了！\p"
"我的宝可梦变得\n"
"强多了！\p"
"可是我不是每次都赢。好像\n"
"跟哪只宝可梦先上场有关。\p"
"{PLAYER}，拜托，我需要你的帮助！\p"
"请帮我决定我的哪只宝可梦\n"
"应该先上场！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1391
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks8"
msgid ""
"Sigh… I'm overwhelmed with happiness…\p"
"It's like a dream having you decide\n"
"for me, {PLAYER}.\p"
"But perfectly understood!\n"
"I will go with my {STR_VAR_1} first!\p"
"I hope you'll be willing to teach me\n"
"some more another time.$"
msgstr ""
"唉……我幸福得快晕过去了……\p"
"能让{PLAYER}帮我决定，\n"
"简直像做梦一样。\p"
"不过，完全明白了！\n"
"我会让{STR_VAR_1}先上场！\p"
"希望下次你还愿意\n"
"再多教我一些。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1400
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst9"
msgid ""
"Hello, hello!\n"
"My mentor, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\l"
"Hit me with your sage advice today!\p"
"You see, I pulled together a team of\n"
"three POKéMON. So far so good.\p"
"But the team's battling order's not\n"
"settled yet.\p"
"This is where you come in, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"You decide which POKéMON leads off!\p"
"Don't be shy now.\n"
"Let's blurt it out!$"
msgstr ""
"哈喽，哈喽！\n"
"我的导师，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\l"
"今天也请赐我高见吧！\p"
"你瞧，我组了一支\n"
"三只宝可梦的队伍。目前还不错。\p"
"可是队伍的出场顺序\n"
"还没定下来。\p"
"这就轮到你出场了，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"由你来决定哪只宝可梦打头阵！\p"
"别害羞嘛。\n"
"直接说出来吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1413
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks9"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh, my {STR_VAR_1} leads off!\n"
"OK, A-OK!\l"
"I'll reorder the lineup, like, wham!\p"
"All right, thanks, as always!\n"
"Adios!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯哼，{STR_VAR_1}打头阵！\n"
"OK，没问题！\l"
"我来重新排阵容，就像，砰！\p"
"好啦，一如既往地谢谢你！\n"
"Adios！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1420
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst10"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, listen!\n"
"It's a crisis!\p"
"My POKéMON, all three of them, go into\n"
"battle at once!\p"
"Of course that's impossible!\n"
"Wahahaha!\p"
"This is no lie, though.\n"
"I'm not very good at thinking about\l"
"how I should line up my POKéMON.\p"
"So, how about deciding for me which\n"
"POKéMON should go first, master?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，听我说！\n"
"出大事了！\p"
"我的宝可梦，三只全部\n"
"同时上场对战了！\p"
"当然是不可能的啦！\n"
"哇哈哈哈！\p"
"不过这次不是骗人的。\n"
"我不太擅长思考\l"
"宝可梦的出场顺序。\p"
"所以，师父，你能帮我决定\n"
"哪只宝可梦先上场吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1433
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks10"
msgid ""
"Okay, so it's my {STR_VAR_1} you chose?\n"
"I'll let any but that one go first!\p"
"Just kidding!\n"
"I'll obey your teaching, master!\p"
"Thanks, master!\n"
"I hope you'll keep teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"好，所以你选的是我的{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"那我就让除了它以外的先上场！\p"
"开玩笑的啦！\n"
"我会听师父的教导的！\p"
"谢谢师父！\n"
"希望你继续教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1441
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst11"
msgid ""
"A-H-O-Y!\n"
"And that spells ahoy!\p"
"The rappin' SAILOR am I!\n"
"I present to you a question\l"
"that's pretty fly!\p"
"It's a team lineup question\n"
"that begs your suggestion!\p"
"Out of this lot, which should go first\n"
"as the first on the spot?$"
msgstr ""
"A-H-O-Y！\n"
"拼起来就是“啊嗨”！\p"
"说唱水手就是我！\n"
"我要问你一个问题\l"
"保证酷到不行！\p"
"这是个出场顺序的问题，\n"
"要请你给点建议！\p"
"这几只里面谁先上，\n"
"第一个冲到战场上？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1452
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks11"
msgid ""
"Okay, I hear you, sure I do!\n"
"I'll switch them up, that I'll do!\p"
"If it's advice I ever need,\n"
"{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"
msgstr ""
"好，我听到了，当然听到啦！\n"
"我这就去换顺序，说到做到啦！\p"
"如果以后需要建议，\n"
"{PLAYER}，你的话我一定牢记！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1458
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst12"
msgid ""
"Yahoo, {PLAYER}!\n"
"How do you do?\p"
"What should I do? Go ahead and ask?\n"
"Uh-huh, I have something to ask!\l"
"Are you receiving me?\l"
"You are receiving me!\p"
"You have to decide, which of my\n"
"POKéMON is the first to ride!\l"
"Into battle, I mean to say.$"
msgstr ""
"呀呼，{PLAYER}！\n"
"你好吗？\p"
"我该怎么办？直接问吗？\n"
"嗯哼，我有事要问！\l"
"你收到了吗？\l"
"你收到我了！\p"
"你得帮我决定，\n"
"我的哪只宝可梦先出征！\l"
"我是说，上场对战。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1469
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks12"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1}? Yes!\n"
"That'll do, there's no distress!\p"
"Well, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\n"
"but don't you forget about me.\p"
"See you again, my smart friend!$"
msgstr ""
"我的{STR_VAR_1}？好耶！\n"
"这样就行，不用发愁也！\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}，我要去流浪了，\n"
"可是别把我忘了哦。\p"
"再见啦，我聪明的朋友！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1476
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst13"
msgid ""
"…Oof…ooch… {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"My stomach's hurting all of a sudden…\p"
"…It's getting better now…\p"
"I must've worried myself sick racking\n"
"my brains on how I should line up\l"
"my posse of POKéMON.\p"
"So, things being this way,\n"
"I need you to decide for me.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, which of my POKéMON should\n"
"go first? So I'd win, I mean.$"
msgstr ""
"……哎哟……好痛……{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"我的肚子突然痛起来了……\p"
"……现在好点了……\p"
"一定是我绞尽脑汁想\n"
"我的宝可梦伙伴们\l"
"该怎么排，结果急出病来了。\p"
"所以，既然情况是这样，\n"
"我需要你帮我决定。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，我的哪只宝可梦\n"
"该先上场？我是说，为了赢。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1488
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks13"
msgid ""
"Hm, all right.\n"
"My {STR_VAR_1} goes first.\p"
"I'll fix the lineup like that after\n"
"I have my supper.\p"
"I hope I can keep hitting you up\n"
"for help like this.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，好的。\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}先上场。\p"
"吃完晚饭后，\n"
"我就照这样调整顺序。\p"
"希望以后还能\n"
"像这样继续找你帮忙。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1496
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst14"
msgid ""
"Er… Um…\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}?\p"
"Please, don't look at me that way.\n"
"You're making me feel all flustered.\p"
"Um…\n"
"I really need your advice.\p"
"It makes me bashful to say this,\n"
"but I chose my 3-POKéMON team.\l"
"I can't decide on the order, though.\p"
"Which POKéMON should I send out first\n"
"so I at least look capable?$"
msgstr ""
"呃……那个……\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}？\p"
"拜托，别那样看着我。\n"
"你让我好慌张。\p"
"嗯……\n"
"我真的需要你的建议。\p"
"说出来有点害羞，\n"
"我选好了三只宝可梦的队伍。\l"
"可是我决定不了顺序。\p"
"我该先派哪只宝可梦，\n"
"才能至少看起来像样一点？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1509
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks14"
msgid ""
"Oh… Okay!\n"
"I'll lead with my {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I hope I can do my best without\n"
"getting all flustered.\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"If we meet again, I hope you will be\l"
"as helpful.$"
msgstr ""
"啊……好的！\n"
"我会让{STR_VAR_1}打头阵。\p"
"希望我能不慌不忙地\n"
"全力以赴。\p"
"谢谢你，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"如果我们再见面，\l"
"希望你还能这样帮我。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1518
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMonFirst15"
msgid ""
"Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"But are you really?\l"
"Perhaps you're a clever look-alike?\p"
"Oh, no, no, no, don't worry!\n"
"If you really are {PLAYER}, please\l"
"forget about my rudeness.\p"
"What I would like is your fine advice.\p"
"I have here my POKéMON team.\n"
"I would like you to tell me which one\l"
"should go first in a battle.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？你看起来像是{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"但你真的是吗？\l"
"说不定是长得很像的人？\p"
"噢，不不不，别在意！\n"
"如果你真的是{PLAYER}，\l"
"请原谅我的失礼。\p"
"我想听听你的高见。\p"
"这是我的宝可梦队伍。\n"
"我想请你告诉我，\l"
"对战时该让哪只先上场。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1530
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonFirstThanks15"
msgid ""
"My {STR_VAR_1}…\n"
"You aren't pulling my leg?\p"
"I see. If that's the case, that's fine.\n"
"I thank you for your time.\p"
"I am as you see, but I shall do\n"
"my best.\p"
"Let us meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"我的{STR_VAR_1}……\n"
"你不是在开我玩笑吧？\p"
"我明白了。既然如此，那就好。\n"
"谢谢你抽出时间。\p"
"我就是这个样子，\n"
"但我会尽力的。\p"
"我们再见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1539
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon0"
msgid ""
"Snivel…\n"
"Oh, {PLAYER}!\p"
"What perfect timing!\n"
"There's something I just can't decide…\p"
"I can't decide which POKéMON I should\n"
"be using.\p"
"I can't decide between the POKéMON\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}…\p"
"{PLAYER}, which do you think will give\n"
"even me a chance at winning?$"
msgstr ""
"呜呜……\n"
"啊，{PLAYER}！\p"
"你来得正好！\n"
"有件事我怎么也决定不了……\p"
"我决定不了\n"
"该用哪只宝可梦。\p"
"我在{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"之间犹豫不决……\p"
"{PLAYER}，你觉得哪个\n"
"能让我这样的人也有机会赢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1551
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks0"
msgid ""
"Snivel… I… I understand!\n"
"Oh! I'm so sorry!\l"
"You've made me so happy, I'm crying…\p"
"I'll do my best to catch one\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Thank you so much!$"
msgstr ""
"呜呜……我、我明白了！\n"
"啊！真对不起！\l"
"你让我太高兴了，我都哭了……\p"
"我会努力抓到一只\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的！\p"
"真的非常感谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1559
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon1"
msgid ""
"Yay! It's {PLAYER}!\n"
"Yay, you came at the right time, too!\l"
"I need your advice again!\p"
"Um, I'm all mixed up--should I use\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}…\p"
"Which do you think I should raise,\n"
"{PLAYER}?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！是{PLAYER}！\n"
"耶，你来得正是时候！\l"
"我又需要你的建议了！\p"
"嗯，我很纠结——该用\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}还是{STR_VAR_2}……\p"
"你觉得我该培育哪个呢，\n"
"{PLAYER}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1568
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks1"
msgid ""
"Oh, so my {STR_VAR_1} is better!\n"
"Okay, I'll do that!\p"
"Thanks for teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"噢，所以{STR_VAR_1}比较好！\n"
"好，我会照做的！\p"
"谢谢你教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1573
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon2"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, hello!\n"
"I have a question I wanted to ask.\p"
"I'm in a dilemma over whether I should\n"
"raise one {STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Which POKéMON do you think will\n"
"be stronger?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，你好！\n"
"我有个问题想问你。\p"
"我在犹豫是该培育\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}还是{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"你觉得哪只宝可梦\n"
"会比较强？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1581
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks2"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} is your choice?\n"
"Okay, I got it!\p"
"I'll go catch a strong {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"right away!\p"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"你选的是{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"好的，我明白了！\p"
"我马上就去抓一只\n"
"强壮的{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1588
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon3"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}…\p"
"Um, you've probably already forgotten\n"
"about someone like me…\p"
"…But that doesn't matter if you\n"
"could give me advice…\p"
"I can't decide on the one kind of\n"
"POKéMON I should raise…\p"
"I've narrowed the field to the POKéMON\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}, but that's\l"
"where I became stuck…\p"
"{PLAYER}, you probably don't want to\n"
"bother, but please decide for me.$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}……\p"
"嗯，你大概早就忘了\n"
"我这样的人了吧……\p"
"……不过只要你能给我建议，\n"
"那也没关系……\p"
"我决定不了\n"
"该培育哪种宝可梦……\p"
"我已经把范围缩小到\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}，\l"
"可是就卡在这里了……\p"
"{PLAYER}，你大概不想管，\n"
"但请帮我决定吧。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1602
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks3"
msgid ""
"But will a wild {STR_VAR_1} even pay\n"
"attention to me?\p"
"I will try!\p"
"But will I even be able to catch one…\n"
"No! I'll do my best!\p"
"Thank you!$"
msgstr ""
"可是野生的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"会理我吗？\p"
"我会试试看！\p"
"可是我真的能抓到吗……\n"
"不！我会努力的！\p"
"谢谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1610
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon4"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}! I'm so glad to see you!\n"
"I was about to go looking for you!\p"
"Can you decide what kind of POKéMON\n"
"I should use?\p"
"For instance…\n"
"How about the POKéMON {STR_VAR_1}\l"
"and {STR_VAR_2}?\p"
"Which one do you think would be\n"
"better?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}！见到你真高兴！\n"
"我正要去找你呢！\p"
"你能帮我决定\n"
"该用哪种宝可梦吗？\p"
"比如说……\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"怎么样？\p"
"你觉得哪个\n"
"比较好？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1621
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks4"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}? That's great!\p"
"Knowing that you made the decision,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\l"
"I lose.\p"
"Okay, I'll look to you for advice again.\n"
"Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}？太好了！\p"
"既然是{PLAYER}{KUN}帮我决定的，\n"
"就算输了我也不会太难过。\p"
"好啦，下次再找你请教。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1629
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon5"
msgid ""
"If it isn't {PLAYER}{KUN}! How's it going?\n"
"I'm busy again as always!\p"
"I want to do good with POKéMON, too,\n"
"but I haven't been able to decide\l"
"which POKéMON I should use.\p"
"You know how {STR_VAR_1} look strong?\n"
"But {STR_VAR_2} are tough to ignore.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, give me some of your good\n"
"advice! Which one'd be good for me?$"
msgstr ""
"这不是{PLAYER}{KUN}嘛！最近怎么样？\n"
"我还是一如既往地忙！\p"
"我也想在宝可梦方面有所作为，\n"
"可是一直决定不了\l"
"该用哪只宝可梦。\p"
"你知道{STR_VAR_1}看起来很强吧？\n"
"可是{STR_VAR_2}也让人难以忽视。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，给我点好建议吧！\n"
"哪个比较适合我？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1640
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks5"
msgid ""
"Okay, gotcha.\n"
"I'll find time somehow and catch me\l"
"that {STR_VAR_1} you recommended.\p"
"I'm glad I met a good mentor in you.\n"
"Thanks! See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"好，明白了。\n"
"我会想办法挤出时间，\l"
"去抓你推荐的{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"能遇到你这么好的导师，我很高兴。\n"
"谢啦！回头见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1647
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon6"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"Yay, it's {PLAYER}!\p"
"I didn't waste any time boasting to\n"
"my friends about meeting you!\p"
"I need to tap your mind again today.\n"
"It's an easy one for you!\p"
"Drum roll, please!\n"
"The question I have is…\p"
"If I were to raise a POKéMON,\n"
"and the choices were one {STR_VAR_1}\l"
"or {STR_VAR_2}, which should it be?$"
msgstr ""
"啊！\n"
"耶，是{PLAYER}！\p"
"我一见到你，就马上\n"
"跟朋友们炫耀了！\p"
"今天我又要借用你的智慧了。\n"
"对你来说很简单啦！\p"
"请来点鼓声！\n"
"我的问题是……\p"
"如果我要培育宝可梦，\n"
"选项是{STR_VAR_1}\l"
"或{STR_VAR_2}，该选哪个？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1660
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks6"
msgid ""
"Ahhh!\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}, you say!\l"
"Thanks for a most cool answer!\p"
"I guess that's about all I wanted\n"
"to ask you today.\p"
"Let's meet here again, okay?\n"
"Thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"啊——！\n"
"你说{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"谢谢你这么酷的回答！\p"
"我今天想问的\n"
"大概就这些了。\p"
"我们下次再在这里见面吧？\n"
"谢谢！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1669
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon7"
msgid ""
"Oh, is it you, {PLAYER}?\n"
"I'm delighted to see you again!\p"
"Ever since I became your apprentice,\n"
"my confidence has been blooming.\p"
"I think I'm ready to raise a POKéMON\n"
"of my own!\p"
"{PLAYER}, may I impose on you to choose\n"
"which POKéMON I should raise?\p"
"The choices are the POKéMON\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}…\l"
"Which POKéMON is right for me?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，是您吗，{PLAYER}？\n"
"很高兴再次见到您！\p"
"自从成为您的徒弟，\n"
"我的信心越来越足了。\p"
"我想我已经准备好培育\n"
"属于自己的宝可梦了！\p"
"{PLAYER}，能否劳烦您\n"
"帮我选一只要培育的宝可梦？\p"
"选项是\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}或{STR_VAR_2}……\l"
"哪只宝可梦适合我呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1682
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks7"
msgid ""
"One {STR_VAR_1} it is!\n"
"I will find one right away!\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I hope I can count on you again.\l"
"Please take care!$"
msgstr ""
"就选{STR_VAR_1}了！\n"
"我马上去找一只！\p"
"谢谢您，{PLAYER}。\n"
"希望以后还能仰仗您。\l"
"请多保重！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1689
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon8"
msgid ""
"Eek! {PLAYER}! I met you again!\n"
"I… I'm overjoyed!\p"
"Oh-oh-oh, I know!\n"
"I shouldn't pass up this opportunity!\p"
"May I ask a huge favor, {PLAYER}?\n"
"Please choose a POKéMON for me!\p"
"Please decide which would be better,\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""
"呀！{PLAYER}！又见到你了！\n"
"我……我高兴死了！\p"
"噢噢噢，对了！\n"
"这个机会我可不能错过！\p"
"{PLAYER}，能拜托你一件大事吗？\n"
"请帮我选一只宝可梦！\p"
"请帮我决定\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}哪个更好！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1699
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks8"
msgid ""
"Wow! You decided for me!\n"
"One {STR_VAR_1} is what I'll raise to\l"
"the best of my ability.\p"
"I hope you'll be willing to teach me\n"
"some more another time.$"
msgstr ""
"哇！你帮我决定了！\n"
"我会竭尽全力\l"
"培育{STR_VAR_1}的。\p"
"希望下次你还愿意\n"
"再多教我一些。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1706
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon9"
msgid ""
"Hey, hey!\n"
"My mentor, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"Hello, I've been looking for you\n"
"for some more of your sage advice!\p"
"Which kind of POKéMON would be right\n"
"for me, one {STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}?\p"
"Don't be shy now.\n"
"Let's blurt it out!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，嘿！\n"
"我的导师，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"你好，我一直在找你，\n"
"想再听听你的高见！\p"
"哪种宝可梦适合我呢？\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}还是{STR_VAR_2}？\p"
"别害羞嘛。\n"
"直接说出来吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1716
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks9"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh, one {STR_VAR_1} it is!\n"
"OK, A-OK!\l"
"I'll get one in a BALL, like, cram!\p"
"All right, thanks, as always!\n"
"Adios!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯哼，就是{STR_VAR_1}了！\n"
"OK，没问题！\l"
"我要把它塞进球里，就像，嘭！\p"
"好啦，一如既往地谢谢你！\n"
"Adios！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1723
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon10"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, listen! Big news!\n"
"I caught a mirage POKéMON!\p"
"Of course I'm lying!\n"
"Wahahaha!\p"
"This is no lie, though.\n"
"I'm not very good at catching\l"
"POKéMON.\p"
"So, how about deciding for me which\n"
"kind of POKéMON I should catch,\l"
"master?\p"
"Which would be better?\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，听我说！大新闻！\n"
"我抓到了一只幻影宝可梦！\p"
"当然是骗你的！\n"
"哇哈哈哈！\p"
"不过这次不是骗人的。\n"
"我不太擅长\l"
"抓宝可梦。\p"
"所以，师父，你能帮我决定\n"
"我该抓哪种宝可梦吗？\p"
"哪个比较好？\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}还是{STR_VAR_2}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1737
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks10"
msgid ""
"Okay, so it's {STR_VAR_1} you chose?\n"
"I'll grab the other kind, then!\p"
"Just kidding!\n"
"I'll obey your teaching, master!\p"
"Thanks, master!\n"
"I hope you'll keep teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"好，所以你选的是{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"那我就去抓另一种了！\p"
"开玩笑的啦！\n"
"我会听师父的教导的！\p"
"谢谢师父！\n"
"希望你继续教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1745
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon11"
msgid ""
"A-H-O-Y!\n"
"And that spells ahoy!\p"
"The rappin' SAILOR am I!\n"
"Surely you remember who am I?\p"
"Today, I have a POKéMON question\n"
"that begs your suggestion!\p"
"I have the choice between this\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}, you see.\l"
"Which is the one to catch for me?$"
msgstr ""
"A-H-O-Y！\n"
"拼起来就是“啊嗨”！\p"
"说唱水手就是我！\n"
"你一定还记得我是谁！\p"
"今天我有个宝可梦的问题，\n"
"要请你给点建议！\p"
"我在{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"之间犹豫，\l"
"该抓哪只，请你给我提示！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1756
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks11"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}, you say, hey, hey!\n"
"I'll go get me one right away!\p"
"If it's advice I ever need,\n"
"{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"
msgstr ""
"你说{STR_VAR_1}，嘿，嘿！\n"
"我马上就去抓一只回来嘿！\p"
"如果以后需要建议，\n"
"{PLAYER}，你的话我一定牢记！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1762
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon12"
msgid ""
"Oh, wow, if it isn't {PLAYER}!\p"
"What should I do? Get your advice?\n"
"Why not? I'm already talking to you!\p"
"It's been a long time. Let me break\n"
"the ice. I'm also looking for advice!\l"
"Are you receiving me?\l"
"You are receiving me!\p"
"My POKéMON--which should I use?\n"
"It's either {STR_VAR_1} or {STR_VAR_2}.\l"
"Which do you choose?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，哇，这不是{PLAYER}嘛！\p"
"我该怎么办？问你建议？\n"
"有何不可？我已经在跟你说话啦！\p"
"好久不见了。让我先来\n"
"破个冰。我也在找建议！\l"
"你收到了吗？\l"
"你收到我了！\p"
"我的宝可梦——该用哪只？\n"
"是{STR_VAR_1}还是{STR_VAR_2}？\l"
"你选哪只？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1774
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks12"
msgid ""
"If that {STR_VAR_1} is the best,\n"
"I'll do as you suggest!\p"
"Well, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\n"
"but don't you forget about me.\p"
"See you again, my smart friend!$"
msgstr ""
"如果{STR_VAR_1}最好，\n"
"我就照你说的做到！\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}，我要去流浪了，\n"
"可是别把我忘了哦。\p"
"再见啦，我聪明的朋友！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1781
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon13"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"I have this horrible headache…\p"
"I must've worried too much about\n"
"the kind of POKéMON I should raise.\p"
"So, things being this way,\n"
"I need you to decide for me.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, if I had to choose between\n"
"the POKéMON {STR_VAR_1} and\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}, which should it be?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，嗨，{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"我头痛得要命……\p"
"一定是我太担心\n"
"该培育哪种宝可梦了。\p"
"所以，既然情况是这样，\n"
"我需要你帮我决定。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，如果要我在\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}之间选，\l"
"该选哪个？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1792
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks13"
msgid ""
"Hm, one {STR_VAR_1}, all right.\n"
"I'll go look for one when I get better.\p"
"I hope I can keep hitting you up\n"
"for help like this.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，{STR_VAR_1}，好的。\n"
"等我好起来就去找一只。\p"
"希望以后还能\n"
"像这样继续找你帮忙。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1798
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon14"
msgid ""
"Er… Um…\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}…?\p"
"Please, don't look at me that way.\n"
"I'm getting all flustered…\l"
"I… I need your advice.\p"
"I… I'm really embarrassed, but I can't\n"
"decide which POKéMON to use.\p"
"If the choices were {STR_VAR_1} or\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}, which would be better?$"
msgstr ""
"呃……那个……\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}……？\p"
"拜托，别那样看着我。\n"
"我好慌张……\l"
"我……我需要你的建议。\p"
"我……真不好意思，可是我\n"
"决定不了该用哪只宝可梦。\p"
"如果选项是{STR_VAR_1}或\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}，哪个比较好？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1809
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks14"
msgid ""
"Oh… Okay!\n"
"I'll do my best with one {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I hope I can do my best without\n"
"getting all flustered.\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"If we meet again, I hope you will be\l"
"as helpful.$"
msgstr ""
"啊……好的！\n"
"我会和{STR_VAR_1}一起努力。\p"
"希望我能不慌不忙地\n"
"全力以赴。\p"
"谢谢你，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"如果我们再见面，\l"
"希望你还能这样帮我。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1818
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMon15"
msgid ""
"Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"But are you really real?\p"
"No, no, if you are real, it's fine.\n"
"Incidentally, I would like to obtain\l"
"your advice.\p"
"It's about the POKéMON I am to use.\p"
"If the choices are the POKéMON\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}, which is\l"
"more worthy of me?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？你看起来像是{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"但你真的是本人吗？\p"
"不，不，如果你是真的就好。\n"
"顺便说一下，我想\l"
"听听你的建议。\p"
"是关于我要用的宝可梦。\p"
"如果选项是\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}，\l"
"哪个更配得上我呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1829
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMonThanks15"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Are you certain?\p"
"I see. If that's the case, that's fine.\n"
"I thank you for your time.\p"
"I do hope it is something even I can\n"
"handle with aplomb.\p"
"Let us meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"你确定吗？\p"
"我明白了。既然如此，那就好。\n"
"谢谢你抽出时间。\p"
"希望那是连我也能\n"
"从容驾驭的宝可梦。\p"
"我们再见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1838
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove0"
msgid ""
"Waaah! Oh, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Snivel… Hiccup…\p"
"I have a dilemma!\n"
"I can't decide on a move for\l"
"my {STR_VAR_1}…\p"
"Please, please, {PLAYER}.\n"
"Can you decide for me?\p"
"For my {STR_VAR_1}, which move would\n"
"be the better choice: {STR_VAR_2}\l"
"or {STR_VAR_3}?$"
msgstr ""
"哇啊！啊，{PLAYER}！\n"
"呜呜……嗝……\p"
"我陷入两难了！\n"
"我决定不了要让\l"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}学什么招式……\p"
"求求你了，{PLAYER}。\n"
"你能帮我决定吗？\p"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}该学哪个招式？\n"
"是{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"还是{STR_VAR_3}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1850
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks0"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"Waaaaah!\p"
"Oh! I'm so sorry, {PLAYER}!\n"
"You've made me so happy by deciding\l"
"the move, I'm crying…\p"
"Snivel…\n"
"Thank you so much!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"哇啊啊啊！\p"
"啊！真对不起，{PLAYER}！\n"
"你帮我决定了招式，\l"
"我太高兴了，就哭出来了……\p"
"呜呜……\n"
"真的非常感谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1859
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove1"
msgid ""
"Yay! Hi, {PLAYER}!\n"
"I need your advice again!\p"
"I want to teach my {STR_VAR_1}\n"
"a cool move.\p"
"I like either of the moves\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}.\l"
"What's your recommendation?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！嗨，{PLAYER}！\n"
"我又需要你的建议了！\p"
"我想教我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"一个很酷的招式。\p"
"我喜欢的招式有\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}和{STR_VAR_3}。\l"
"你推荐哪个？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1868
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks1"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} is better? I guess so!\n"
"Okay, I'll go with that!\p"
"If we meet here again, please teach\n"
"me something else, teacher!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}比较好？应该是吧！\n"
"好，就用那个！\p"
"下次在这里遇到的话，\n"
"再教我别的事吧，老师！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1874
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove2"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, hello!\n"
"It's about my {STR_VAR_1}, but I'm\l"
"worried about its moves.\p"
"You see, it's the moves {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"and {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"Which is stronger and better for\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，你好！\n"
"是关于我的{STR_VAR_1}，\l"
"我在为它的招式发愁。\p"
"你看，就是{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"和{STR_VAR_3}这两个招式。\p"
"哪个对我的{STR_VAR_1}来说\n"
"更强、更好呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1883
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks2"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} is your choice?\n"
"Okay, I got it!\p"
"I'll go teach {STR_VAR_1} to\n"
"my POKéMON right away!\p"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"你选的是{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"好的，我明白了！\p"
"我马上就去\n"
"教我的宝可梦{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1890
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove3"
msgid ""
"Ohhh, {PLAYER}…\n"
"I'm hopeless, no, really!\p"
"I've decided to raise a POKéMON,\n"
"but now I can't even decide what\l"
"move I should let it learn…\p"
"I know that it doesn't mean anything\n"
"to you, {PLAYER}.\p"
"But it means a lot to me…\p"
"Please, {PLAYER}, could you choose\n"
"a move for my {STR_VAR_1}?\p"
"If you could even choose between\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_3}…$"
msgstr ""
"唉……{PLAYER}……\n"
"我真没用，真的！\p"
"我决定培育一只宝可梦，\n"
"可是现在连该让它学什么\l"
"招式都决定不了……\p"
"我知道这对你来说\n"
"根本无所谓，{PLAYER}。\p"
"可是对我来说很重要……\p"
"拜托，{PLAYER}，你能帮\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}选个招式吗？\p"
"哪怕只是在{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"和{STR_VAR_3}之间选一个……$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1904
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks3"
msgid ""
"I understand!\p"
"But will it even be willing to learn\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} for me…\l"
"No! I'll do my best!\p"
"Thank you!$"
msgstr ""
"我明白了！\p"
"可是它真的愿意为我学\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}吗……\l"
"不！我会努力的！\p"
"谢谢你！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1911
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove4"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"I was just hoping to see you, too!\p"
"I was wondering what move would\n"
"be suitable for my {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I can't decide, so can you decide\n"
"for me instead?\p"
"For instance… How about the moves\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_3}?\l"
"Which one would be better?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我正想见你呢！\p"
"我在想什么招式\n"
"适合我的{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我决定不了，所以\n"
"你能帮我决定吗？\p"
"比如说……{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"和{STR_VAR_3}这两个招式？\l"
"哪个比较好？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1922
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks4"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}? That's great!\p"
"Knowing that you made the decision,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I won't be so upset if\l"
"I lose.\p"
"Okay, I'll look to you for advice again.\n"
"Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}？太好了！\p"
"既然是{PLAYER}{KUN}帮我决定的，\n"
"就算输了我也不会太难过。\p"
"好啦，下次再找你请教。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1930
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove5"
msgid ""
"How could things be this busy?\n"
"Hey, if it isn't {PLAYER}{KUN}!\l"
"How's it going?\p"
"Since I got up this morning, I've done\n"
"my jogging, swimming, and cooking!\p"
"You wouldn't believe how busy I am!\p"
"I can't even decide what move\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1} should learn!\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} looks good, huh?\n"
"But {STR_VAR_3}'s also decent.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, give me some of your good\n"
"advice! Which move'd be good for me?$"
msgstr ""
"怎么会这么忙啊？\n"
"嘿，这不是{PLAYER}{KUN}嘛！\l"
"最近怎么样？\p"
"从今天早上起床到现在，\n"
"我已经慢跑、游泳、做饭了！\p"
"你都不敢相信我有多忙！\p"
"我连我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"该学什么招式都决定不了！\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}看起来不错吧？\n"
"可是{STR_VAR_3}也挺好的。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，给我点好建议吧！\n"
"哪个招式比较适合我？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1944
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks5"
msgid ""
"Okay, gotcha.\n"
"I'll make room in my schedule and\l"
"teach that move.\p"
"I'm glad I met a good mentor in you.\n"
"Thanks! See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"好，明白了。\n"
"我会挤出时间\l"
"去教那个招式。\p"
"能遇到你这么好的导师，我很高兴。\n"
"谢啦！回头见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1951
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove6"
msgid ""
"Oh! Lucky!\n"
"I met you again, {PLAYER}!\l"
"I need to tap your mind again today.\p"
"Drum roll, please!\n"
"The question I have is…\p"
"For my {STR_VAR_1}, which is the move\n"
"best suited, {STR_VAR_2} or\l"
"{STR_VAR_3}?$"
msgstr ""
"啊！好走运！\n"
"又遇到你了，{PLAYER}！\l"
"今天我又要借用你的智慧了。\p"
"请来点鼓声！\n"
"我的问题是……\p"
"对我的{STR_VAR_1}来说，\n"
"最适合的招式是{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"还是{STR_VAR_3}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1961
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks6"
msgid ""
"Ahhh!\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}, you say!\l"
"Thanks for a most cool answer!\p"
"I guess that's about all I wanted\n"
"to ask you today.\p"
"Let's meet here again, okay?\n"
"Thanks!$"
msgstr ""
"啊——！\n"
"你说{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"谢谢你这么酷的回答！\p"
"我今天想问的\n"
"大概就这些了。\p"
"我们下次再在这里见面吧？\n"
"谢谢！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1970
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove7"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I trust you've been well?\p"
"I have to seek your advice again.\n"
"It's about my dearest {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"What would be the ideal move for\n"
"my lovable {STR_VAR_1}?\l"
"{STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，您好，{PLAYER}。\n"
"您近来一切安好吧？\p"
"我又得向您请教了。\n"
"是关于我最心爱的{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"对我可爱的{STR_VAR_1}来说，\n"
"最理想的招式是什么？\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}还是{STR_VAR_3}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1979
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks7"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} it is!\n"
"I will teach that right away!\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I hope I can count on you again.\l"
"Please take care!$"
msgstr ""
"就是{STR_VAR_1}了！\n"
"我马上就去教它！\p"
"谢谢您，{PLAYER}。\n"
"希望以后还能仰仗您。\l"
"请多保重！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1986
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove8"
msgid ""
"Eek! {PLAYER}! I met you again!\n"
"I… I'm overjoyed!\p"
"Whenever I'm in need, you're always\n"
"there for me, {PLAYER}!\p"
"Today, I want you to recommend\n"
"a move for me!\p"
"Please choose a move for\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Which move would be better,\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}?$"
msgstr ""
"呀！{PLAYER}！又见到你了！\n"
"我……我高兴死了！\p"
"每当我需要帮助的时候，\n"
"你总是在我身边，{PLAYER}！\p"
"今天，我想请你\n"
"帮我推荐一个招式！\p"
"请帮我的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"选一个招式！\p"
"哪个招式比较好，\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}还是{STR_VAR_3}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:1998
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks8"
msgid ""
"Oh-oh-oh! Thank you!\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} is it!\l"
"Perfectly understood!\p"
"I hope you'll be willing to teach me\n"
"some more another time.$"
msgstr ""
"噢噢噢！谢谢你！\n"
"就是{STR_VAR_1}了！\l"
"完全明白了！\p"
"希望下次你还愿意\n"
"再多教我一些。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2005
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove9"
msgid ""
"Hola, {PLAYER}{KUN}, bueno!\n"
"I'm hoping for some more of\l"
"your sage advice today!\p"
"What would be the best move for\n"
"my {STR_VAR_1}?\p"
"It should be something that'll\n"
"let me win just like that!\p"
"Would it be {STR_VAR_2}?\n"
"Or {STR_VAR_3}?$"
msgstr ""
"Hola，{PLAYER}{KUN}，bueno！\n"
"今天我也想\l"
"再听听你的高见！\p"
"对我的{STR_VAR_1}来说，\n"
"什么招式最好？\p"
"最好是能让我\n"
"一下子就赢的招式！\p"
"是{STR_VAR_2}？\n"
"还是{STR_VAR_3}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2016
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks9"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh, {STR_VAR_1} it is!\n"
"Si, bueno!\l"
"I'll get it taught, like, ka-blam!\p"
"All right, thanks, as always!\n"
"Adios!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯哼，就是{STR_VAR_1}了！\n"
"Si，bueno！\l"
"我这就去教它，就像，轰！\p"
"好啦，一如既往地谢谢你！\n"
"Adios！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2023
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove10"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, it's completely wild!\p"
"My POKéMON!\n"
"It learned six moves!\p"
"Of course I'm lying!\n"
"Wahahaha!\p"
"This is no lie, though.\n"
"I'm not very good at choosing moves\l"
"for my POKéMON.\p"
"So, how about deciding for me which\n"
"kind of move I should teach?\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}--which\n"
"would go with my {STR_VAR_1} best?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，太不可思议了！\p"
"我的宝可梦！\n"
"它学会了六个招式！\p"
"当然是骗你的！\n"
"哇哈哈哈！\p"
"不过这次不是骗人的。\n"
"我不太擅长\l"
"给宝可梦选招式。\p"
"所以，你能帮我决定\n"
"该教哪种招式吗？\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}和{STR_VAR_3}——\n"
"哪个最适合我的{STR_VAR_1}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2037
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks10"
msgid ""
"Okay, so it's {STR_VAR_1} you chose?\n"
"I'll choose another move, then!\p"
"Just kidding!\n"
"I'll obey your teaching, master!\p"
"Thanks, master!\n"
"I hope you'll keep teaching me!$"
msgstr ""
"好，所以你选的是{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"那我就选别的招式了！\p"
"开玩笑的啦！\n"
"我会听师父的教导的！\p"
"谢谢师父！\n"
"希望你继续教我！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2045
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove11"
msgid ""
"A-H-O-Y!\n"
"And that spells ahoy!\p"
"The rappin' SAILOR am I!\n"
"I'm always with it, don't ask me why.\p"
"Today, I have a move question\n"
"that begs your suggestion!\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_3} are\n"
"the moves. What would be the best\l"
"for my {STR_VAR_1} so it grooves?$"
msgstr ""
"A-H-O-Y！\n"
"拼起来就是“啊嗨”！\p"
"说唱水手就是我！\n"
"我永远走在潮流前面，别问为何！\p"
"今天我有个招式的问题，\n"
"要请你给点建议！\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}和{STR_VAR_3}，\n"
"这两个招式哪个最好，\l"
"能让我的{STR_VAR_1}嗨到爆？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2056
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks11"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}, you say, hey, hey!\n"
"I'll go teach that right away!\p"
"If it's advice I ever need,\n"
"{PLAYER}, your word I'll always heed!$"
msgstr ""
"你说{STR_VAR_1}，嘿，嘿！\n"
"我马上就去教它嘿！\p"
"如果以后需要建议，\n"
"{PLAYER}，你的话我一定牢记！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2062
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove12"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeahah, if it isn't {PLAYER}!\p"
"What should I do? Get your advice?\n"
"Why not? I'm already talking to you!\p"
"{PLAYER}, are you surprised by me?\n"
"I want your advice, can't you see?\p"
"Are you receiving me?\n"
"You are receiving me!\p"
"My {STR_VAR_1}--what should it use?\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3},\l"
"what do you choose?$"
msgstr ""
"噢，耶啊，这不是{PLAYER}嘛！\p"
"我该怎么办？问你建议？\n"
"有何不可？我已经在跟你说话啦！\p"
"{PLAYER}，你被我吓到了吗？\n"
"我想要你的建议，你看不出吗？\p"
"你收到了吗？\n"
"你收到我了！\p"
"我的{STR_VAR_1}——该用什么？\n"
"是{STR_VAR_2}还是{STR_VAR_3}，\l"
"你选哪个招式？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2074
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks12"
msgid ""
"If that {STR_VAR_1} is the best,\n"
"I'll do as you suggest!\p"
"Well, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\n"
"but don't you forget about me.\p"
"See you again, my smart friend!$"
msgstr ""
"如果{STR_VAR_1}最好，\n"
"我就照你说的做到！\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}，我要去流浪了，\n"
"可是别把我忘了哦。\p"
"再见啦，我聪明的朋友！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2081
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove13"
msgid ""
"Gahack! Gaah! Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"I have this lousy cold, I do…\p"
"I want to pick a move for my POKéMON,\n"
"but I'm not up to it…\p"
"So, things being this way,\n"
"I need you to decide for me.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, if I had to choose between\n"
"{STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_3} for\l"
"my {STR_VAR_1}, which would it be?$"
msgstr ""
"咳咳！咳啊！啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"我得了重感冒……\p"
"我想帮我的宝可梦选招式，\n"
"可是我实在没力气……\p"
"所以，既然情况是这样，\n"
"我需要你帮我决定。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，如果要在\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}和{STR_VAR_3}之间\l"
"选一个给我的{STR_VAR_1}，该选哪个？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2092
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks13"
msgid ""
"Hm, {STR_VAR_1}, all right. Cough!\n"
"I'll go teach it when I get better.\p"
"I hope I can keep hitting you up\n"
"for help like this.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯，{STR_VAR_1}，好的。咳！\n"
"等我好起来就去教它。\p"
"希望以后还能\n"
"像这样继续找你帮忙。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2098
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove14"
msgid ""
"Er… Um…\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}…?\p"
"Please, don't look at me that way.\n"
"I'm getting all flustered…\l"
"I… I need your advice.\p"
"I… I'm really embarrassed, but I can't\n"
"decide what move I should teach\l"
"my POKéMON.\p"
"It's for my {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"If the choices were {STR_VAR_2} or\l"
"{STR_VAR_3}, which would be better?$"
msgstr ""
"呃……那个……\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}……？\p"
"拜托，别那样看着我。\n"
"我好慌张……\l"
"我……我需要你的建议。\p"
"我……真不好意思，可是我\n"
"决定不了该教我的宝可梦\l"
"什么招式。\p"
"是我的{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"如果选项是{STR_VAR_2}或\l"
"{STR_VAR_3}，哪个比较好？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2111
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks14"
msgid ""
"Oh… Okay!\n"
"I'll try that {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I hope I can teach that move…\n"
"This is so nerve-racking…\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"If we meet again, I hope you will be\l"
"as helpful.$"
msgstr ""
"啊……好的！\n"
"我会试试{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"希望我能教会它那个招式……\n"
"好紧张啊……\p"
"谢谢你，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"如果我们再见面，\l"
"希望你还能这样帮我。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2120
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWhichMove15"
msgid ""
"Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"But are you really real?\p"
"Perhaps you're one of those popular\n"
"mimics?\p"
"No, no, if you are real, it's fine.\n"
"No need to be upset, I assure you!\p"
"Incidentally, I would like to obtain\n"
"your advice.\p"
"It's about my {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Which move would be better for it to\n"
"use, {STR_VAR_2} or {STR_VAR_3}?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？你看起来像是{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"但你真的是本人吗？\p"
"说不定你是那种\n"
"很受欢迎的模仿秀艺人？\p"
"不，不，如果你是真的就好。\n"
"别生气，我向你保证！\p"
"顺便说一下，我想\n"
"听听你的建议。\p"
"是关于我的{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"它用哪个招式比较好？\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}还是{STR_VAR_3}？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2133
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeMoveThanks15"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}?\n"
"There's no question about that?\p"
"I see. If that's the case, that's fine.\n"
"I thank you for your time.\p"
"I do hope it is something even\n"
"my POKéMON can learn.\p"
"Let us meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}？\n"
"这点毫无疑问吗？\p"
"我明白了。既然如此，那就好。\n"
"谢谢你抽出时间。\p"
"希望那是连我的宝可梦\n"
"也能学会的招式。\p"
"我们再见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2142
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech0"
msgid ""
"Oh… {PLAYER}?\n"
"It is {PLAYER}!\l"
"Oh! Sniff…sob… Please, listen!\p"
"I… When I battle, I get so nervous,\n"
"I can't help crying even if I win…\p"
"I wish I could say something cool\n"
"when I win…\p"
"Please, please, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Could you maybe teach me something\l"
"cool to say when I win so I don't cry?$"
msgstr ""
"啊……{PLAYER}？\n"
"真的是{PLAYER}！\l"
"啊！呜……呜呜……请听我说！\p"
"我……我一对战就好紧张，\n"
"就算赢了也忍不住会哭……\p"
"我真希望赢的时候\n"
"能说点帅气的话……\p"
"求求你了，{PLAYER}！\n"
"你能不能教我一句赢的时候说的\l"
"帅气台词，让我不再哭了？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2154
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks0"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Awesome! Wicked! Awoooh!\n"
"It's really cool!\p"
"Oh… I'm sorry…\n"
"I'm so happy, I'm crying…\p"
"Snivel… {PLAYER}!\n"
"Thank you so much for everything!\p"
"I will battle the best I can for\n"
"your sake, {PLAYER}!\p"
"{PLAYER}…\n"
"Next time… We should battle!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"太棒了！太酷了！嗷呜——！\n"
"真的好帅！\p"
"啊……对不起……\n"
"我太高兴了，都哭出来了……\p"
"呜呜……{PLAYER}！\n"
"谢谢你为我做的一切！\p"
"为了你，{PLAYER}，\n"
"我会尽全力去对战！\p"
"{PLAYER}……\n"
"下次……我们来对战吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2167
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech1"
msgid ""
"Yay! It's {PLAYER}! Hello!\n"
"I wanted to ask you something!\p"
"I want to say something cool when\n"
"I win a match.\p"
"Do you have a cool saying that\n"
"you could recommend?$"
msgstr ""
"耶！是{PLAYER}！你好！\n"
"我想问你一件事！\p"
"我想在赢得比赛的时候\n"
"说一句很酷的话。\p"
"你有什么酷炫的台词\n"
"可以推荐给我吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2175
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks1"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Oh, wow! That is so cool!\n"
"Okay, I'll say that!\p"
"Thanks for teaching me all this time!\n"
"I'm going to do the best I can\l"
"wherever I go from now on!\p"
"When we meet again, it'll be for\n"
"a battle!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"哇！好酷啊！\n"
"好，我就这么说！\p"
"谢谢你一直以来教我这么多！\n"
"从今以后，不管去哪里，\l"
"我都会全力以赴！\p"
"下次见面的时候，\n"
"我们就来对战吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2185
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech2"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, hello!\p"
"My POKéMON and I are ready for\n"
"anything, except for one thing.\p"
"I think it would be good if I had\n"
"something to shout when I win.\p"
"Could you think up something good\n"
"to say?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，你好！\p"
"我和我的宝可梦已经万事俱备，\n"
"只差一件事。\p"
"我觉得要是赢的时候\n"
"能喊点什么就好了。\p"
"你能帮我想一句\n"
"好台词吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2194
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks2"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"…Cool!\n"
"I will use that!\p"
"I'm going out to battle all over\n"
"the place.\p"
"Who knows, I may even get to battle\n"
"you one day, {PLAYER}.\p"
"Next time, let's meet at a place\n"
"of battle!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"……好酷！\n"
"我就用这句了！\p"
"我要出发去\n"
"各地对战了。\p"
"说不定有一天，\n"
"我还能和你对战呢，{PLAYER}。\p"
"下次，我们在对战的地方\n"
"见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2205
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech3"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}…\n"
"I'm sorry to bug you, but I'm hopeless…\p"
"Even when…\n"
"Even when I win, I don't have anything\l"
"special to say…\p"
"I know that it doesn't mean anything\n"
"to you, {PLAYER}.\p"
"But it means a lot to me…\p"
"Please, {PLAYER}, what should I say\n"
"if I win a battle?$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}……\n"
"抱歉又来烦你，可是我真没用……\p"
"就算……\n"
"就算我赢了，我也没有什么\l"
"特别的话可说……\p"
"我知道这对你来说\n"
"根本无所谓，{PLAYER}。\p"
"可是对我来说很重要……\p"
"拜托，{PLAYER}，如果我赢了\n"
"对战，该说什么好呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2217
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks3"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"That's inspired…\p"
"Uh… Is it okay for someone like me\n"
"to even say that?\p"
"No! I'll do my best!\p"
"{PLAYER}, thank you so much for\n"
"putting up with me for so long…\p"
"I promise to do my best from now on.\p"
"I'm sure you'll quickly forget about\n"
"someone like me, but let's meet\l"
"somewhere again!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"真有灵感……\p"
"呃……像我这样的人\n"
"也能说这种话吗？\p"
"不！我会努力的！\p"
"{PLAYER}，谢谢你一直以来\n"
"这么包容我……\p"
"我保证从今以后会努力的。\p"
"我想你很快就会忘了\n"
"我这样的人，但我们\l"
"有缘再见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2230
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech4"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"There's something I want you to hear.\p"
"I know that I don't always sound\n"
"nice or polite…\p"
"When I win a battle, I think I come\n"
"across as being arrogant.\p"
"I don't want people to dislike me,\n"
"so I want to say something nice to\l"
"someone I beat.\p"
"But I can't think of anything good!\n"
"Could you think something up for me?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"有件事我想让你听听。\p"
"我知道我说话\n"
"不一定很友善、很礼貌……\p"
"赢了对战的时候，\n"
"我好像会显得很傲慢。\p"
"我不想被人讨厌，\n"
"所以想对被我打败的人\l"
"说点好听的话。\p"
"可是我想不出什么好话！\n"
"你能帮我想一句吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2243
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks4"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Not bad!\n"
"Yup, that's what I'll go with!\p"
"I'm going to hit the road and do what\n"
"I can with what you taught me in\l"
"my head and heart.\p"
"I'm sorry that I've been so pushy\n"
"with you!\p"
"Next time, we battle, okay?\n"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"不错嘛！\n"
"嗯，就用这句了！\p"
"我要出发了，\n"
"带着你教我的一切，\l"
"用心尽力去做。\p"
"对不起，我一直\n"
"对你那么强势！\p"
"下次我们来对战，好吗？\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2255
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech5"
msgid ""
"Oh, I can't get over how busy I am!\n"
"Oh, hey, I was looking for you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"Are you well as usual?\n"
"Things haven't changed for me at all.\p"
"I've got running, fighting, and mapping\n"
"to do. Why am I so busy?\p"
"But even though I'm busy, it'd be rude\n"
"to just turn on my heels and walk away\l"
"from a win without saying a word.\p"
"So, what would be a cool saying to\n"
"underline my coolness when I'm done\l"
"and walking away? {PLAYER}{KUN}, help me!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，我怎么会这么忙啊！\n"
"噢，嘿，我正在找你呢，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"你还是老样子吗？\n"
"我这边是一点都没变。\p"
"我要跑步、打架、还要画地图。\n"
"我怎么会这么忙？\p"
"不过就算再忙，赢了以后\n"
"一句话不说就转身走掉，\l"
"也太没礼貌了。\p"
"所以，赢了以后转身离开时，\n"
"说什么才能更显得我很帅？\l"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，帮帮我吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2269
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks5"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Okay, gotcha.\n"
"I can find time to say that!\p"
"Honestly, I'm glad I met a good mentor\n"
"like you.\p"
"I'm going to make time somehow so\n"
"I can get into battling.\p"
"Thanks for everything, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"We have to battle, you and me, one day!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"好，明白了。\n"
"这句话我有时间说！\p"
"说真的，能遇到你这样的\n"
"好导师，我很高兴。\p"
"我会想办法挤出时间，\n"
"好好投入对战。\p"
"谢谢你为我做的一切，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"总有一天，我们要来一场对战！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2280
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech6"
msgid ""
"I lucked out again!\n"
"{PLAYER}! Am I glad to see you!\l"
"Like usual, I need your advice!\p"
"Drum roll, please!\n"
"The last question I have is…\p"
"If I win a battle and want to end\n"
"it with a cool flourish, what\l"
"should I say?$"
msgstr ""
"我又走运了！\n"
"{PLAYER}！见到你真高兴！\l"
"跟平常一样，我需要你的建议！\p"
"请来点鼓声！\n"
"我最后的问题是……\p"
"如果我赢了对战，想用\n"
"帅气的方式收尾，\l"
"我该说什么好呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2290
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks6"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"That… That's fabulous!\n"
"It's dignified and cool! I claim it!\p"
"…Listen, I think I'm getting decent\n"
"at this, huh?\p"
"So, I'm thinking of challenging other\n"
"TRAINERS from now on.\p"
"{PLAYER}, your advice really helped me.\p"
"Maybe one day, there'll be a time when\n"
"we battle!\p"
"Thank you for everything!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"这……这太棒了！\n"
"既有气势又帅气！我要了！\p"
"……我说，我好像\n"
"越来越有模有样了吧？\p"
"所以，从今以后我打算\n"
"去挑战其他训练家。\p"
"{PLAYER}，你的建议真的帮了我大忙。\p"
"说不定总有一天，\n"
"我们会有对战的时候！\p"
"谢谢你为我做的一切！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2303
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech7"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}.\n"
"I'm so glad I met you!\p"
"I no longer have any concerns with\n"
"regard to my POKéMON.\p"
"It's myself that worries me…\p"
"Do you know how a TRAINER says\n"
"a few things upon winning a battle?\p"
"Definitely, I wish I could do that,\n"
"too!\p"
"Please, what should I say when\n"
"I win a battle?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}。\n"
"能遇见您真是太好了！\p"
"关于我的宝可梦，\n"
"我已经没有任何顾虑了。\p"
"让我担心的是我自己……\p"
"您知道训练家在赢了对战后\n"
"都会说几句话吧？\p"
"我也非常希望\n"
"能那样做！\p"
"请问，我赢了对战的时候\n"
"该说什么呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2316
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks7"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Ah! That saying! It refreshes me\n"
"and makes me feel reborn!\p"
"I must use that right away!\p"
"And now, I must take my leave,\n"
"{PLAYER}…\p"
"I will go out to battle many others,\n"
"but never will I forget your teachings.\p"
"Perhaps one day…\n"
"Farewell!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"啊！这句话！让我神清气爽，\n"
"仿佛获得了新生！\p"
"我得马上用上这句话！\p"
"那么，我该告辞了，\n"
"{PLAYER}……\p"
"我会去和许多人对战，\n"
"但我永远不会忘记您的教诲。\p"
"也许有一天……\n"
"后会有期！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2328
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech8"
msgid ""
"Eek! I spotted {PLAYER}!\n"
"I… I'm overjoyed to see you!\p"
"Oh-oh-oh! There's something I just\n"
"had to ask you!\p"
"A little while ago, I won a battle.\n"
"That part was giddying!\p"
"But it made me so overjoyed that\n"
"I choked up and couldn't say a thing!\p"
"So now, {PLAYER}, please, I want you to\n"
"think up an exit line for when I win!$"
msgstr ""
"呀！我看到{PLAYER}了！\n"
"我……见到你我高兴死了！\p"
"噢噢噢！我有件事\n"
"一定要问你！\p"
"不久前，我赢了一场对战。\n"
"那时真是乐晕了！\p"
"可是我太高兴了，\n"
"结果哽咽得一句话都说不出来！\p"
"所以，{PLAYER}，拜托你\n"
"帮我想一句赢了时的退场台词！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2340
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks8"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Waaaaah!\n"
"I'm going to say that?!\l"
"I… I'm delirious with joy!\p"
"Th-th-thank you!\n"
"I have nothing left to regret now!\p"
"I'm going to travel now and battle\n"
"all sorts of people.\p"
"Everything, I owe it to you, {PLAYER}.\n"
"Really, really, thank you!\p"
"I've got to go now, but let's meet\n"
"in battle one day!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"哇啊啊啊！\n"
"我要说这句吗？！\l"
"我……我高兴得要发疯了！\p"
"谢、谢、谢谢你！\n"
"我现在没有任何遗憾了！\p"
"我现在要去旅行，\n"
"和各种各样的人对战。\p"
"这一切都多亏了你，{PLAYER}。\n"
"真的，真的很谢谢你！\p"
"我得走了，不过总有一天\n"
"我们在对战中再见吧！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2354
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech9"
msgid ""
"Hola, bueno!\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"You know, I'm getting the itch to roam\n"
"and battle where I may.\p"
"But before I do, I want your advice\n"
"once again, please!\p"
"If I were to win a battle, what would\n"
"be a good boast I could say to my\l"
"fallen TRAINER opponent?$"
msgstr ""
"Hola，bueno！\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"你知道吗，我开始心痒痒，\n"
"想四处流浪对战了。\p"
"不过在那之前，\n"
"我想再听一次你的建议！\p"
"如果我赢了对战，\n"
"该对被我打败的训练家\l"
"说什么炫耀的话才好？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2365
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks9"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Uh-huh, that's sweet!\n"
"Si, bueno!\l"
"I'll try saying that, like, ham!\p"
"And now, it's time to say good-bye!\n"
"Thanks for all sorts of things!\p"
"Give me a battle one day, OK?\n"
"Adios!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"嗯哼，真不错！\n"
"Si，bueno！\l"
"我会试着这么说，就像，嘿！\p"
"现在，该说再见了！\n"
"谢谢你为我做的种种！\p"
"总有一天跟我对战吧，OK？\n"
"Adios！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2375
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech10"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, there's big trouble!\p"
"When I win a battle, I brag about it\n"
"for an hour at least!\p"
"Of course I'm lying!\n"
"Wahahaha!\p"
"This is no lie, though.\n"
"I'm not very good at chatting.\p"
"So, how about deciding for me what\n"
"I should say after winning a battle,\l"
"master?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，出大事了！\p"
"我只要赢了对战，\n"
"就会至少炫耀一个小时！\p"
"当然是骗你的！\n"
"哇哈哈哈！\p"
"不过这次不是骗人的。\n"
"我不太擅长聊天。\p"
"所以，师父，你能帮我决定\n"
"赢了对战之后\l"
"该说什么吗？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2387
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks10"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"That's what I should say, huh?\n"
"Then, I'll stay away from that!\p"
"Just kidding!\n"
"I'll obey your teaching, master!\p"
"Thanks for teaching me all this time,\n"
"master!\p"
"I'm finally understanding what being\n"
"a TRAINER is about.\p"
"I'm going to go out and win battles\n"
"against any TRAINER.\p"
"Maybe it'll be you one day, master!\p"
"That's all!\n"
"Farewell, my master!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"我该说的就是这句吗？\n"
"那我偏不说这句！\p"
"开玩笑的啦！\n"
"我会听师父的教导的！\p"
"谢谢你一直以来教我，\n"
"师父！\p"
"我终于明白\n"
"当训练家是怎么回事了。\p"
"我要去和任何训练家\n"
"对战并取胜。\p"
"说不定有一天对手就是你哦，师父！\p"
"就这样！\n"
"再会了，我的师父！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2403
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech11"
msgid ""
"A-H-O-Y!\n"
"And that spells ahoy!\p"
"The rappin' SAILOR am I!\n"
"This will be my last question,\l"
"don't you cry!\p"
"It's a saying question\n"
"that begs your suggestion!\p"
"If I win a match, what can I say\n"
"in a real cool way?$"
msgstr ""
"A-H-O-Y！\n"
"拼起来就是“啊嗨”！\p"
"说唱水手就是我！\n"
"这是我最后一个问题，\l"
"你可别哭着说不舍！\p"
"这是个台词的问题，\n"
"要请你给点建议！\p"
"如果我赢了比赛，该说什么\n"
"才能帅得让人喝彩？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2414
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks11"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Perfect! That's what I'll use.\n"
"I was right to make you choose!\p"
"And now, I think it'd be best,\n"
"if I were to fly the nest!\p"
"Thanks for all you taught me.\n"
"I'll be off on a battle spree!\p"
"B-O-N-V-O-Y-A-G-E!\n"
"And that spells bon voyage,\l"
"to you this is my homage!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"完美！我就用这句了。\n"
"让你来选果然没选错嘛！\p"
"现在，我想最好的做法，\n"
"就是离巢去闯天涯！\p"
"谢谢你教我的一切。\n"
"我要去展开连番对战了！\p"
"B-O-N-V-O-Y-A-G-E！\n"
"拼起来就是“一路顺风”，\l"
"这是我对你的致敬，老兄！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2426
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech12"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, {PLAYER}!\n"
"I found you again today!\p"
"What should I do? Ask you again?\n"
"Why not? I'm already asking you!\p"
"Anyways, {PLAYER}…\n"
"Are you receiving me?\l"
"You are receiving me!\l"
"I need some more advice for me!\p"
"It's about what I should yell.\n"
"Something cool to holler when\l"
"a battle ends well.\p"
"Come on, I wanna hear you say it!$"
msgstr ""
"噢，耶，{PLAYER}！\n"
"今天我又找到你啦！\p"
"我该怎么办？再问你一次？\n"
"有何不可？我已经在问你啦！\p"
"总之，{PLAYER}……\n"
"你收到了吗？\l"
"你收到我了！\l"
"我还需要更多建议！\p"
"是关于我该喊什么。\n"
"对战顺利结束的时候，\l"
"要喊点什么帅气的话。\p"
"快点，我想听你说出来！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2440
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks12"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"All right, all right!\n"
"I'll use that because it's so tight!\p"
"I'm out of things to ask you.\n"
"Waving bye is all that's left to do.\p"
"But maybe one day we'll meet, with one\n"
"destined to go down in defeat.\p"
"But, it really is time to say farewell.\p"
"Well, {PLAYER}, I have to roam free,\n"
"but don't you forget about me!\p"
"Take care, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Love ya!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"好的，好的！\n"
"这句太带劲了，我就用它！\p"
"我已经没什么要问你的了。\n"
"剩下的只有挥手说再见了。\p"
"不过也许有一天我们会相遇，\n"
"其中一人注定要败下阵去。\p"
"不过，真的到了说再见的时候了。\p"
"好了，{PLAYER}，我要去流浪了，\n"
"可是别把我忘了哦！\p"
"保重，{PLAYER}！\n"
"爱你哟！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2454
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech13"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I'm finished…\n"
"My nose won't stop dripping…\p"
"I was trying to think up something\n"
"cool to say when I win a battle.\p"
"It inspired me so much, it made me cry,\n"
"and now my nose won't stop running…\p"
"So, things being this way,\n"
"I need you to decide for me, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"When I win a battle,\n"
"what should I say?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，我完蛋了……\n"
"我的鼻涕流个不停……\p"
"我一直在想\n"
"赢了对战时说什么帅气的话。\p"
"结果我太感动了，都哭了，\n"
"现在鼻涕流个不停……\p"
"所以，既然情况是这样，\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，我需要你帮我决定。\p"
"我赢了对战的时候，\n"
"该说什么呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2466
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks13"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"… … …That's good.\n"
"No, it's awe inspiring!\l"
"It's bringing fresh tears to my eyes!\p"
"But in spite of my tears and runny\n"
"nose, I will use that saying!\p"
"I'm plumb out of things to ask you,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"From now on, we're rivals!\n"
"Thanks for everything!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"…… …… ……很好。\n"
"不，简直让人肃然起敬！\l"
"我又要流泪了！\p"
"就算我眼泪鼻涕直流，\n"
"我也要用这句台词！\p"
"我已经没有什么要问你的了，\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"从今以后，我们就是对手了！\n"
"谢谢你为我做的一切！$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2478
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech14"
msgid ""
"Er… Um…\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"Please, don't look at me that way.\n"
"You're making me all nervous.\p"
"I… I need your advice again.\n"
"I'll make it my last, though…\p"
"It's really embarrassing to ask,\n"
"but what if I win a battle?\l"
"What should I say?$"
msgstr ""
"呃……那个……\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}……\p"
"拜托，别那样看着我。\n"
"你让我好紧张。\p"
"我……我又需要你的建议了。\n"
"不过这是最后一次了……\p"
"问这个真的很难为情，\n"
"但如果我赢了对战，\l"
"我该说什么呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2489
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks14"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"Oh… Okay!\n"
"I'll try to say that!\l"
"I might be too nervous to say it…\p"
"Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"I have to say good-bye now.\p"
"I'll obey all that you've taught me,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, and do the best I can.$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"啊……好的！\n"
"我会试着这么说！\l"
"不过我可能会紧张得说不出口……\p"
"谢谢你，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我得跟你道别了。\p"
"我会遵从你教我的一切，\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，尽我所能。$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2499
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticePickWinSpeech15"
msgid ""
"Hm? You appear to be {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"But are you really?\l"
"Perhaps a clever {PLAYER} DOLL?\p"
"Oh, no, no, no, don't worry!\n"
"If you really are real, please\l"
"forget about my rudeness.\p"
"No need to be so angry. All I wish for\n"
"is more of your fine advice.\p"
"It concerns a saying.\p"
"More precisely, what should I say\n"
"if I win a battle?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？你看起来像是{PLAYER}{KUN}……\n"
"但你真的是吗？\l"
"说不定是做得很像的{PLAYER}玩偶？\p"
"噢，不不不，别在意！\n"
"如果你真的是本人，\l"
"请原谅我的失礼。\p"
"别那么生气嘛。我只是\n"
"想再听听你的高见。\p"
"是关于一句台词。\p"
"更准确地说，如果我赢了对战，\n"
"该说什么呢？$"

#: data/text/apprentice.inc:2512
msgctxt "gText_ApprenticeWinSpeechThanks15"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"When I win a match…\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"…Are you serious?\p"
"I see. If you are serious, that's fine.\n"
"I thank you for your time.\p"
"I do hope even I will be able to\n"
"put that saying to good use.\p"
"I seem to have run dry on what advice\n"
"I need.\p"
"I do believe it's high time I bid you\n"
"farewell and strike out on my own.\p"
"Thank you, my mentor!\n"
"I apologize for my skepticism!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"当我赢了比赛……\p"
"{STR_VAR_1}\p"
"……你是认真的吗？\p"
"我明白了。如果你是认真的，那就好。\n"
"谢谢你抽出时间。\p"
"希望连我也能\n"
"好好运用这句台词。\p"
"我需要的建议\n"
"好像都问完了。\p"
"我想是时候向你告别，\n"
"独自出发了。\p"
"谢谢你，我的导师！\n"
"请原谅我的多疑！$"
